&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Every day, tens of millions of people come to Roblox to explore, create, play, learn, and connect with friends in 3D immersive digital experiences– all created by our global community of developers and creators.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Roblox, we’re building the tools and platform that empower our community to bring any experience that they can imagine to life. Our vision is to reimagine the way people come together, from anywhere in the world, and on any device.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We’re on a mission to connect a billion people with optimism and civility, and looking for amazing talent to help us get there.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;A career at Roblox means you’ll be working to shape the future of human interaction, solving unique technical challenges at scale, and helping to create safer, more civil shared experiences for everyone.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Roblox, we believe advanced research belongs in production, driving core algorithmic advances at a global scale. Machine Learning is a key growth lever, powering everything from real-time 3D generative AI to complex ecosystem economics across our global platform. As an Applied Scientist - PhD Intern, you’ll be part of a community of curious scientists and engineers&amp;nbsp; building the foundational and applied ML methods at a scale of millions of daily active users and billions of daily AI requests. We combine innovative research—including Computer Vision and Graphics, multimodality, NLP, and recommendation systems—with world scaling distributed engineering.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;During your 12 or 16 week internship in the Winter, Summer, or Fall, you’ll own a high-impact project from ideation and experimentation to production and publication. There’s also the possibility of continued collaboration beyond your internship, as we support experimentation and production with top researchers, engineers, faculty, and PhD candidates globally that can lead to publications at esteemed venues.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Will&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prototype, experiment with, and deploy advanced AI, machine learning, and 3D technologies to solve real-world challenges at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate cutting-edge research into production-ready features alongside our community of curious, cross-functional engineering and product teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop, deliver, and optimize solutions that measurably enhance user experience, safety, and creativity on our platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Possess or are pursuing a PhD in computer science, engineering, or a related field, with a thesis aligned to Roblox’s research areas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep expertise in a relevant technical domain, including deep learning, computer vision, NLP, reinforcement learning, or distributed systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in one or more programming languages (e.g., Python, C++, Go, Java) with experience building and optimizing large-scale systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong research track record, evidenced by multiple publications and presentations in highly regarded peer-reviewed venues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You may redact age, date of birth, and dates of attendance/graduation from your resume.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;For roles that are based at our headquarters in San Mateo, CA: The starting base pay for this position is as shown below. The actual base pay is dependent upon a variety of job-related factors such as professional background, training, work experience, location, business needs and market demand. Therefore, in some circumstances, the&amp;nbsp;actual hourly rate&amp;nbsp;could fall outside of this expected range. This pay range is subject to change and may be modified in the future.&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;Please note that not all benefits shown on &lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.roblox.com/total-rewards&quot;&gt;this page&lt;/a&gt; are applicable to internship opportunities.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Hourly Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$72&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$72 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Roles that are based in an office are onsite Tuesday, Wednesday, and Thursday, with optional presence on Monday and Friday (unless otherwise noted).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Roblox provides equal employment opportunities to all employees and applicants for employment and prohibits discrimination and harassment of any type without regard to race, color, religion, age, sex, national origin, disability status, genetics, protected veteran status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state or local laws. Roblox also provides reasonable accommodations to candidates with qualifying disabilities or religious beliefs during the recruiting process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For US based roles only, please note the Company may not be able to employ candidates for this role who have United States work authorization related to certain U.S. visa categories, or support future H-1B sponsorship at this time.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Every day, tens of millions of people come to Roblox to explore, create, play, learn, and connect with friends in 3D immersive digital experiences– all created by our global community of developers and creators.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Roblox, we’re building the tools and platform that empower our community to bring any experience that they can imagine to life. Our vision is to reimagine the way people come together, from anywhere in the world, and on any device.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We’re on a mission to connect a billion people with optimism and civility, and looking for amazing talent to help us get there.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;A career at Roblox means you’ll be working to shape the future of human interaction, solving unique technical challenges at scale, and helping to create safer, more civil shared experiences for everyone.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;As an Associate Product Designer (APD), your journey begins with a 21-month rotational program designed to give you hands-on experience across our platform, with supportive mentorship. You’ll tackle complex, real-world design challenges with cross-functional partners across engineering and product management, creating meaningful products and features that directly impact millions of users every day. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Applications for this position will close on Friday, November 20th at 5 PM PST.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;You Will:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct user research and usability testing to deeply understand user needs, behaviors, and motivations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply learnings and best practices to design systems, prototyping tools, and accessibility to projects across our platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advocate for our community of players and creators, solving user challenges while maintaining a high bar for quality and consistency throughout the design process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Receive ongoing mentorship, feedback, and professional development opportunities for growth as a product designer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;You Are:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pursuing or possessing an undergraduate/graduate degree in Design (i.e., UX/UI, Interaction, Motion, Graphics, Typography, Web, or Product) or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient in design and prototyping tools, such as Figma and Adobe Creative Cloud.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curious about people&#39;s behaviors, needs, and motivations, recognizing this as essential to the design process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Aesthetically inclined, valuing the design of the world around you, from software and hardware to architecture and art.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please note the Company may not be able to employ candidates who have United States work authorization related to certain U.S. visa categories, or support future H-1B sponsorship at this time. You may redact age, date of birth, and dates of attendance/graduation from your resume.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;San Mateo, CA&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;For roles that are based at our headquarters in San Mateo, CA: The starting base pay for this position is as shown below. The actual base pay is dependent upon a variety of job-related factors such as professional background, training, work experience, location, business needs and market demand. Therefore, in some circumstances, the actual salary could fall outside of this expected range. This pay range is subject to change and may be modified in the future. All full-time employees are also eligible for equity compensation and for benefits as described on &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.roblox.com/total-rewards&quot;&gt;this page&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Annual Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$140,450&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$140,450 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Roles that are based in an office are onsite Tuesday, Wednesday, and Thursday, with optional presence on Monday and Friday (unless otherwise noted).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Roblox provides equal employment opportunities to all employees and applicants for employment and prohibits discrimination and harassment of any type without regard to race, color, religion, age, sex, national origin, disability status, genetics, protected veteran status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state or local laws. Roblox also provides reasonable accommodations to candidates with qualifying disabilities or religious beliefs during the recruiting process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For US based roles only, please note the Company may not be able to employ candidates for this role who have United States work authorization related to certain U.S. visa categories, or support future H-1B sponsorship at this time.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Every day, tens of millions of people come to Roblox to explore, create, play, learn, and connect with friends in 3D immersive digital experiences– all created by our global community of developers and creators.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Roblox, we’re building the tools and platform that empower our community to bring any experience that they can imagine to life. Our vision is to reimagine the way people come together, from anywhere in the world, and on any device.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We’re on a mission to connect a billion people with optimism and civility, and looking for amazing talent to help us get there.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;A career at Roblox means you’ll be working to shape the future of human interaction, solving unique technical challenges at scale, and helping to create safer, more civil shared experiences for everyone.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Roblox’s 21-month Associate Product Manager (APM) rotational program is designed to cultivate well-rounded product leaders through mentorship, guided learning, and hands-on execution. You’ll have the opportunity to collaborate with cross-functional partners to learn about our full platform ecosystem, applying that knowledge to&amp;nbsp; build and enhance features used by millions of players and creators every day, spanning payment systems, consumer mobile apps, social features, and game development.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Applications for this position will close on Friday, November 20th at 5 PM PST - we recruit on a rolling basis.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You Will:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build product features that millions of users will interact with every day, sharing updates, progress, and learnings to stakeholders across the business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with senior product managers to define product strategy and roadmaps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with cross-functional partners in design, data science, product marketing and engineering to write specifications, experimentation plans and go-to-market briefs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct user research, gather feedback, and analyze data to identify creator community needs and opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support market research and competitive analysis to inform product decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Upon completing the 21-month rotational cycle, APMs have the opportunity to graduate and join Roblox as a full time Product Manager (PM) within a specific team at Roblox.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You Are:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pursuing or possessing an undergraduate/graduate degree in computer science, engineering, information systems, business, mathematics or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passionate about user experience, building products and features that delight our community as they play, create, and connect.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curious about user experiences, seeking to understand what drives behaviors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborative partner, comfortable sharing and presenting your ideas across different audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
