&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities to scale automation coverage as Roblox&#39;s 25+ global data centers expand.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;FinOps&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee cloud spend optimization and on-prem vs. cloud allocation decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Grow and develop the FinOps function, which is lean today but increasing in strategic importance as cloud spend scales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Finance to ensure infrastructure spend is visible, justified, and optimized.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You Have:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of experience in infrastructure, data center operations, or related fields, with at least 3 years in a director-level or senior leadership role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep expertise in capacity planning and supply-demand analysis for large-scale infrastructure environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on familiarity with DCIM systems and data center automation — this role is lower in the stack than platform software (not Kubernetes/cloud-native).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working across supply chain systems, hardware procurement, and deployment execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to lead and scale cross-functional teams including software engineers, planners, and operations specialists.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical and communication skills; comfortable translating complex infrastructure decisions for C-suite audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with AI/GPU infrastructure - Roblox is actively building GPU factory capacity aligned with NVIDIA&#39;s next-generation hardware roadmap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing a FinOps function or cloud cost optimization at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in hyperscale, colocation, or edge data center environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to liquid cooling infrastructure for high-density compute.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;You Will&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own a critical piece of infrastructure for a platform used by hundreds of millions of people worldwide.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scale the team to support ongoing growth and new product features.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive improvements in partnership with other engineering teams across Roblox&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create a culture and practice of production excellence, security, and cost-efficiency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hire and develop senior engineers, managers, and leaders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborative, low-ego environment where candid feedback is welcomed and acted on.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;For roles that are based at our headquarters in San Mateo, CA: The starting base pay for this position is as shown below. The actual base pay is dependent upon a variety of job-related factors such as professional background, training, work experience, location, business needs and market demand. Therefore, in some circumstances, the actual salary could fall outside of this expected range. This pay range is subject to change and may be modified in the future. All full-time employees are also eligible for equity compensation and for benefits as described on &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.roblox.com/total-rewards&quot;&gt;this page&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Annual Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$399,420&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$457,970 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Roles that are based in an office are onsite Tuesday, Wednesday, and Thursday, with optional presence on Monday and Friday (unless otherwise noted).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Roblox provides equal employment opportunities to all employees and applicants for employment and prohibits discrimination and harassment of any type without regard to race, color, religion, age, sex, national origin, disability status, genetics, protected veteran status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state or local laws. Roblox also provides reasonable accommodations to candidates with qualifying disabilities or religious beliefs during the recruiting process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For US based roles only, please note the Company may not be able to employ candidates for this role who have United States work authorization related to certain U.S. visa categories, or support future H-1B sponsorship at this time.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Every day, tens of millions of people come to Roblox to explore, create, play, learn, and connect with friends in 3D immersive digital experiences– all created by our global community of developers and creators.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Roblox, we’re building the tools and platform that empower our community to bring any experience that they can imagine to life. Our vision is to reimagine the way people come together, from anywhere in the world, and on any device.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We’re on a mission to connect a billion people with optimism and civility, and looking for amazing talent to help us get there.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;A career at Roblox means you’ll be working to shape the future of human interaction, solving unique technical challenges at scale, and helping to create safer, more civil shared experiences for everyone.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;As&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Director, Developer Relations – &lt;/strong&gt;Europe, you will lead Roblox’s developer ecosystem strategy and growth across Europe. You will be accountable for defining the regional strategy, establishing the partnerships and programs required to execute it, and delivering measurable outcomes for the Roblox developer ecosystem.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will build deep relationships with leading developers, studios, publishers, technology partners, and emerging creators while identifying the next generation of high-potential partners for Roblox. You will serve as a senior representative of Roblox within the regional games and technology industries and as an executive-level advocate for the needs and opportunities of developers within Roblox.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role requires both strategic vision and operational leadership. You will translate Roblox’s global priorities into a regional strategy, identify opportunities and barriers to ecosystem growth, and mobilize teams across Product, Engineering, Marketing, Partnerships, Creator, and International to deliver against those opportunities.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Note: &lt;/strong&gt;This is a 1-year contract position, with the potential to convert to a full-time role, subject to business needs and mutual agreement.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tack record of building trusted relationships with game developers, studios, or publishers.&amp;nbsp; Developer relations, partner or account management, business development, licensing or partnerships experience preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experienced leading regional or ecosystem strategy with measurable business impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deeply knowledgeable about the games and developer landscape in Europe.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to influence senior internal and external stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data-driven, strategic, and comfortable operating in ambiguity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiar with Roblox Studio, Unity, Unreal, or similar development tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in one or more of the following European languages is a plus: Dutch, German, French, Spanish, Italian, Polish, Swedish, or Finnish.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Based in the Netherlands or willing to relocate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Will&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the multi-year developer ecosystem strategy for Europe.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive developer acquisition, engagement, and long-term success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build executive relationships with key studios, publishers, and ecosystem partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify regional developer needs and influence Roblox product priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set goals, metrics, and operating rhythms for regional ecosystem growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner cross-functionally to turn strategy into execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent Roblox at major industry and developer events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Surface market trends, opportunities, and risks to senior leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and lead the regional Developer Relations organization as the opportunity grows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Success Looks Like&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Success in this role means that Roblox has a clear and durable developer ecosystem strategy for Europe, stronger relationships with the region’s most important developers and studios, a growing pipeline of high-potential developers building on Roblox, and a measurable increase in the quality and success of experiences emerging from the region.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Roles that are based in an office are onsite Tuesday, Wednesday, and Thursday, with optional presence on Monday and Friday (unless otherwise noted).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Roblox provides equal employment opportunities to all employees and applicants for employment and prohibits discrimination and harassment of any type without regard to race, color, religion, age, sex, national origin, disability status, genetics, protected veteran status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state or local laws. Roblox also provides reasonable accommodations to candidates with qualifying disabilities or religious beliefs during the recruiting process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For US based roles only, please note the Company may not be able to employ candidates for this role who have United States work authorization related to certain U.S. visa categories, or support future H-1B sponsorship at this time.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Every day, tens of millions of people come to Roblox to explore, create, play, learn, and connect with friends in 3D immersive digital experiences– all created by our global community of developers and creators.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Roblox, we’re building the tools and platform that empower our community to bring any experience that they can imagine to life. Our vision is to reimagine the way people come together, from anywhere in the world, and on any device.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We’re on a mission to connect a billion people with optimism and civility, and looking for amazing talent to help us get there.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;A career at Roblox means you’ll be working to shape the future of human interaction, solving unique technical challenges at scale, and helping to create safer, more civil shared experiences for everyone.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;The platforms in our Engineering Acceleration org dictate how thousands of Roblox engineers ship, and how every backend service gets built, deployed, and kept reliable at scale. They sit on the critical path for production reliability, developer velocity, and security posture. Reporting to Andrew Swerdlow, you will rethink the entire engineering toolchain from the ground up to be agentic-native, creating a world where AI agents are first-class participants in software development and humans set direction and supervise. This is a unique opportunity to define what modern engineering infrastructure looks like at one of the largest platforms in the world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reimagine the engineering toolchain as agentic-native, designing the platforms, guardrails, and feedback loops that let AI agents safely drive migrations, validation, and routine operational work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set a bold technical direction for AI-driven quality, including agent-generated tests, automated coverage of untested paths, intelligent verification, and continuous-deployment workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make software quality and SEV prevention a measurable property of the platform by investing in safe-change mechanisms, automated verification, progressive rollout, and fast, reliable rollback.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive down operational toil through automation, transforming manual, repeat work like patching and large-scale migrations into self-serve or agent-driven workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and drive the roadmap, aligning cross-pod plans and execution against company goals for safe rollouts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading and growing engineering teams (including managing managers and/or senior ICs), with a strong people-development track record.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong technical depth in backend/distributed systems and cloud infrastructure, enabling you to engage credibly on system design and technical decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record delivering internal developer platforms, CI/CD, or deployment systems at scale for many internal customers and services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong point of view on how AI/agentic tooling changes engineering workflows, coupled with hands-on familiarity with the modern AI engineering stack, AI coding tools, eval design, and open-weight models.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated cross-organizational collaboration and excellent communication skills, with the ability to translate ambiguous, multi-system problems into concrete, executable plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;(Preferred)&lt;/em&gt; Backend proficiency in C# and/or Go, and familiarity with Kubernetes/Nomad (Hashistack), Temporal, and AWS.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;(Preferred)&lt;/em&gt; Hands-on experience applying AI/agents to engineering workflows, with a background in safe/staged rollouts (canary, feature flags) and incident prevention/automated verification.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;For roles that are based at our headquarters in San Mateo, CA: The starting base pay for this position is as shown below. The actual base pay is dependent upon a variety of job-related factors such as professional background, training, work experience, location, business needs and market demand. Therefore, in some circumstances, the actual salary could fall outside of this expected range. This pay range is subject to change and may be modified in the future. All full-time employees are also eligible for equity compensation and for benefits as described on &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.roblox.com/total-rewards&quot;&gt;this page&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Annual Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$399,420&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$457,970 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Roles that are based in an office are onsite Tuesday, Wednesday, and Thursday, with optional presence on Monday and Friday (unless otherwise noted).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Roblox provides equal employment opportunities to all employees and applicants for employment and prohibits discrimination and harassment of any type without regard to race, color, religion, age, sex, national origin, disability status, genetics, protected veteran status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state or local laws. Roblox also provides reasonable accommodations to candidates with qualifying disabilities or religious beliefs during the recruiting process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For US based roles only, please note the Company may not be able to employ candidates for this role who have United States work authorization related to certain U.S. visa categories, or support future H-1B sponsorship at this time.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Every day, tens of millions of people come to Roblox to explore, create, play, learn, and connect with friends in 3D immersive digital experiences– all created by our global community of developers and creators.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Roblox, we’re building the tools and platform that empower our community to bring any experience that they can imagine to life. Our vision is to reimagine the way people come together, from anywhere in the world, and on any device.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We’re on a mission to connect a billion people with optimism and civility, and looking for amazing talent to help us get there.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;A career at Roblox means you’ll be working to shape the future of human interaction, solving unique technical challenges at scale, and helping to create safer, more civil shared experiences for everyone.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;As Director, Law Enforcement &amp;amp; Critical Harms Operations, you’ll lead three key verticals within Roblox Safety Operations:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Law Enforcement Operations:&lt;/strong&gt; the operational backbone of Roblox’s law enforcement collaboration, responsible for the scaled review and processing of global law enforcement requests seeking the disclosure of Roblox account records.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Critical Harms Investigations &amp;amp; Incident Management: &lt;/strong&gt;the team responsible for comprehensively investigating, managing, and working across the company to mitigate Roblox’s highest-risk safety incidents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Critical Harms Product Support:&lt;/strong&gt; the team responsible for collaborating with Product, Engineering, and other internal partners to combat critical platform harms, including via scaled operations responding to critical harms abuse reports and proactive reporting to law enforcement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate will be a versatile, self-driven, team-player who enjoys context-switching across high-profile initiatives, and has an exceptional safety operations track record.&amp;nbsp; Through your work, you’ll become an expert in Roblox’s safety practices, advance our tooling and investigative capabilities, and work across a variety of teams to surface, analyze, and ultimately disrupt threat actors.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please note: &lt;/strong&gt;This role will require reviewing graphic, controversial, and offensive content in accordance with Roblox’s handling policies. This role will also require On-Call support during weekends and holidays.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll report to the Senior Director, Moderation, Intelligence &amp;amp; Law Enforcement Operations.This full-time, hybrid position is located at our headquarters in San Mateo, CA&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the above-referenced verticals, including people management and coaching, and delivering on aggressive operational metrics like SLA and quality.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the company’s response to safety incidents by coordinating with cross-functional stakeholders, providing real-time communications to leadership, and driving post hoc Root Cause Analyses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Seek to understand and empathetically respond to law enforcement concerns, while helping internally codify and scale resultant learnings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Legal, Public Policy, and other teams to implement new legal/regulatory requirements in operational workflows.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Engineering teams to scope, test, and launch enhanced internal compliance and investigations tooling.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate and build strong internal relationships across our Legal &amp;amp; Advocacy, Safety, Product, and Communications teams (among others) to help address law enforcement emergencies, platform safety escalations, and comprehensive Roblox undertakings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Forge a deep subject-matter expertise of Roblox’s internal and external safety practices, so as to identify, advocate for, and help implement strategic safety enhancements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of leading exceptional safety operations in law enforcement, intelligence, government, or trust and safety.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep familiarity with U.S. and non-U.S. law enforcement response frameworks, e.g., U.S. Stored Communications Act, CLOUD Act, emergency disclosures, and cross-border constraints.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience owning and successfully leading others in high-pressure, sensitive, and complex investigations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record managing high-volume operations queues, and building standard operating procedures, training programs, QA frameworks, and operational dashboards.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Subject-matter expertise in child safety laws, policies, and considerations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication, leadership, and stakeholder management skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Agility to navigate ambiguity, resilience to overcome obstacles, and the internal drive to concurrently manage multiple high-profile, time-sensitive initiatives in a dynamic environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Unwavering integrity, collegiality, and grit.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;For roles that are based at our headquarters in San Mateo, CA: The starting base pay for this position is as shown below. The actual base pay is dependent upon a variety of job-related factors such as professional background, training, work experience, location, business needs and market demand. Therefore, in some circumstances, the actual salary could fall outside of this expected range. This pay range is subject to change and may be modified in the future. All full-time employees are also eligible for equity compensation and for benefits as described on &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.roblox.com/total-rewards&quot;&gt;this page&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Annual Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$261,800&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$311,810 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Roles that are based in an office are onsite Tuesday, Wednesday, and Thursday, with optional presence on Monday and Friday (unless otherwise noted).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Roblox provides equal employment opportunities to all employees and applicants for employment and prohibits discrimination and harassment of any type without regard to race, color, religion, age, sex, national origin, disability status, genetics, protected veteran status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state or local laws. Roblox also provides reasonable accommodations to candidates with qualifying disabilities or religious beliefs during the recruiting process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For US based roles only, please note the Company may not be able to employ candidates for this role who have United States work authorization related to certain U.S. visa categories, or support future H-1B sponsorship at this time.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Every day, tens of millions of people come to Roblox to explore, create, play, learn, and connect with friends in 3D immersive digital experiences– all created by our global community of developers and creators.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Roblox, we’re building the tools and platform that empower our community to bring any experience that they can imagine to life. Our vision is to reimagine the way people come together, from anywhere in the world, and on any device.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We’re on a mission to connect a billion people with optimism and civility, and looking for amazing talent to help us get there.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;A career at Roblox means you’ll be working to shape the future of human interaction, solving unique technical challenges at scale, and helping to create safer, more civil shared experiences for everyone.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Roblox is currently at a critical inflection point in its financial evolution. We recently achieved a significant payout milestone to our Creator community in 2025. To successfully build upon this momentum year over year while controlling our costs, a world-class payments and wallets ecosystem is essential to ensure frictionless transactions across the platform for our Users and Creators.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;This role offers the rare opportunity to lead a &lt;strong&gt;0-to-1 buildout&lt;/strong&gt; of a new payments division. If successful, you will transition Roblox from standard payment processing to a strategic orchestration model, utilizing AI-driven approach to optimize significant transaction cost.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Beyond cost savings, you will spearhead the transformation of our creator payouts, building a product designed to empower the livelihood of millions of developers through instant, transparent, and global financial access.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Will&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own Global Partnership Negotiation &amp;amp; Account Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead RFPs and high-stakes contractual negotiations with major global payment processors (e.g., Stripe, PayPal, etc) and financial institutions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Establish formal business relationships where none currently exist, securing advantageous commercial terms that are accretive to Roblox’s bottom line.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build Payment Orchestration Strategy &amp;amp; Development:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead the transition from current legacy systems to a multi-partner orchestration system.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Achieve optimal routing based on cost and conversion, potentially saving hundreds of millions of dollars in transaction fees in year one.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
