&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Administration team at Roblox provides core administrative support and serves as strategic partners to our business leaders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;You Will:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide executive support to the Chief Business Officer and VP, Business Development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategically manage complex calendars — allocating time against priorities, protecting focus time, and proactively resolving conflicts before they surface.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a trusted operational proxy for executives – ensuring their time is optimized, they are delegating effectively, and anticipating what is needed before being asked.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive continuous process improvement across the org — identifying what isn&#39;t working, owning the fix, and sharing better practices with the broader E/ABP community.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plan and execute impactful team events, including team building activities, off-sites, and recognition programs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain team communication channels, meeting notes, project plans, goals, and group tasks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage the confidential execution of organizational changes, including information flow, timing, and discretion across sensitive people movements.&lt;/li&gt;
