&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience scaling a global consumer marketplace, gaming platform, social platform, or creator ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with personalization, recommendation systems, growth automation, or machine learning-driven optimization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing large-scale paid media budgets ($10M+ annually).&lt;/li&gt;
