&lt;p&gt;Roblox&#39;s Integrated Marketing team leads the integrated campaigns and major brand moments that shape how the world sees Roblox, from creator-led live events to global brand campaigns. We work across social, paid, live content, influencer, events and owned channels with Creative, Comms, Media, Product Marketing and regional teams. This is a temporary role, owning high-visibility programs end to end during a busy stretch of events and campaigns.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead strategy and execution of tentpole campaigns, including LiveOps events, brand partnership activations, Creator Showdown and game activations, and influencer-led programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage agency and vendor partners for creative and asset production, setting creative checkpoints, decision points and escalation paths at the start of vendor-led work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and manage integrated marketing plans across social, paid, live content, influencer and owned channels with Creative, Social, Comms, Media and regional teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Product Marketing to bring launches to market, translating product value into credible, audience-first messaging and launch plans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define success metrics, report on campaign results, and use insights to refine messaging, creative and channel strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of integrated marketing experience, ideally in consumer tech, gaming, platforms or creator-driven ecosystems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of the gaming ecosystem, including live service games, UGC platforms and creator-driven economies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with creators and influencers, including partnership management and content briefs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading cross-channel campaigns across social, video, paid media, live content and events in multiple markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong storytelling, organizational and project management skills, with a clear creative point of view and sound judgment on credibility and authenticity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Preferred: experience running large events or tentpole moments, and the ability to ramp quickly in a temporary role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;For roles that are based at our headquarters in San Mateo, CA: The starting base pay for this position is as shown below. The actual base pay is dependent upon a variety of job-related factors such as professional background, training, work experience, location, business needs and market demand. Therefore, in some circumstances, the&amp;nbsp;actual hourly rate&amp;nbsp;could fall outside of this expected range. This pay range is subject to change and may be modified in the future.&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;Please note that not all benefits shown on &lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.roblox.com/total-rewards&quot;&gt;this page&lt;/a&gt; are applicable to this temporary position.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Monthly Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$14,765&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$19,532 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Roles that are based in an office are onsite Tuesday, Wednesday, and Thursday, with optional presence on Monday and Friday (unless otherwise noted).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Roblox provides equal employment opportunities to all employees and applicants for employment and prohibits discrimination and harassment of any type without regard to race, color, religion, age, sex, national origin, disability status, genetics, protected veteran status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state or local laws. Roblox also provides reasonable accommodations to candidates with qualifying disabilities or religious beliefs during the recruiting process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For US based roles only, please note the Company may not be able to employ candidates for this role who have United States work authorization related to certain U.S. visa categories, or support future H-1B sponsorship at this time.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Every day, tens of millions of people come to Roblox to explore, create, play, learn, and connect with friends in 3D immersive digital experiences– all created by our global community of developers and creators.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Roblox, we’re building the tools and platform that empower our community to bring any experience that they can imagine to life. Our vision is to reimagine the way people come together, from anywhere in the world, and on any device.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We’re on a mission to connect a billion people with optimism and civility, and looking for amazing talent to help us get there.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;A career at Roblox means you’ll be working to shape the future of human interaction, solving unique technical challenges at scale, and helping to create safer, more civil shared experiences for everyone.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for an International Operations Manager to drive and manage the operational cadence supporting our international structure across local country teams. You will spearhead cross-functional execution, lead end-to-end work item and resource planning, and operationalize group reporting, goal-setting, and performance tracking. In this role, you’ll build, own, and optimize the rhythms (such as QBRs, regular business reviews, and scorecards) that keep global workstreams aligned, resourced, and delivered on schedule.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This full-time, hybrid (in-office on Tues/Wed/Thurs) position is based in our San Mateo office and reports to the Head of International Strategy &amp;amp; Ops.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Will: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead Cadence &amp;amp; Operating Rhythms: &lt;/strong&gt;Spearhead and own internal operating cadences and reporting, including leading quarterly business reviews, establishing regular review rhythms with local international teams, and driving core alignment across regions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Item &amp;amp; Resource Planning: &lt;/strong&gt;Lead work item prioritization, project planning, and resource allocation across cross-functional teams (Marketing, Comms, Trust &amp;amp; Safety, Business Development, Finance, Legal) to ensure local market initiatives are properly scoped and supported.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Execution Management: &lt;/strong&gt;Oversee master project plans, timelines, and resource dependencies, actively driving follow-ups and hold owners accountable to keep all global deliverables on track.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and track core operational performance metrics and resource utilization, creating executive reporting for leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gather inputs from country teams and XFN partners and synthesize into clear status updates, risks, and next steps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead recurring operational cadences (regional check-ins, QBR prep, scorecards, resource allocation, and annual/quarterly planning cycles).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify recurring operational gaps and implement process improvements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain and improve playbooks for repeatable workflows within local country teams across the world&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as an operational point of contact between country teams and HQ partners for planning, execution, and issue triage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate with external vendors/agencies as needed&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flag execution risks early (dependencies, resourcing, approvals, timelines) and help coordinate escalations to the right owners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Legal/Compliance/Trust &amp;amp; Safety to ensure required steps are followed for market initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Have:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree or equivalent practical experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;6+ years&lt;/strong&gt; of experience in operations, program management, business operations, or cross-functional project coordination.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting international or multi-region teams is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong project management fundamentals (planning, tracking, risk management, stakeholder updates).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable driving clarity across multiple stakeholders in a fast-moving environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written and verbal communication skills, with the ability to synthesize and simplify.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analytical and organized, with strong attention to detail and follow-through.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with tooling such as spreadsheets, dashboards, and project trackers (e.g., Airtable, Asana/Jira) is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;For roles that are based at our headquarters in San Mateo, CA: The starting base pay for this position is as shown below. The actual base pay is dependent upon a variety of job-related factors such as professional background, training, work experience, location, business needs and market demand. Therefore, in some circumstances, the actual salary could fall outside of this expected range. This pay range is subject to change and may be modified in the future. All full-time employees are also eligible for equity compensation and for benefits as described on &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.roblox.com/total-rewards&quot;&gt;this page&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Annual Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$210,930&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$251,230 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Roles that are based in an office are onsite Tuesday, Wednesday, and Thursday, with optional presence on Monday and Friday (unless otherwise noted).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Roblox provides equal employment opportunities to all employees and applicants for employment and prohibits discrimination and harassment of any type without regard to race, color, religion, age, sex, national origin, disability status, genetics, protected veteran status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state or local laws. Roblox also provides reasonable accommodations to candidates with qualifying disabilities or religious beliefs during the recruiting process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For US based roles only, please note the Company may not be able to employ candidates for this role who have United States work authorization related to certain U.S. visa categories, or support future H-1B sponsorship at this time.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Every day, tens of millions of people come to Roblox to explore, create, play, learn, and connect with friends in 3D immersive digital experiences– all created by our global community of developers and creators.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Roblox, we’re building the tools and platform that empower our community to bring any experience that they can imagine to life. Our vision is to reimagine the way people come together, from anywhere in the world, and on any device.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We’re on a mission to connect a billion people with optimism and civility, and looking for amazing talent to help us get there.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;A career at Roblox means you’ll be working to shape the future of human interaction, solving unique technical challenges at scale, and helping to create safer, more civil shared experiences for everyone.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an Intellectual Property Counsel to join Roblox’s Legal and Advocacy team. In this role, you will advise and collaborate with various teams within the business on a broad array of legal matters related to intellectual property, including IP enforcement and protection, intermediary liability and copyright, and trade secrets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Successful candidates will have strong experience advising on current legal frameworks and risks in the intellectual property space, including infringement assessment, IP disputes, platform liability, global copyright frameworks, artificial intelligence, and other emerging technology issues. This is a great opportunity to join a growing legal team, learn about interesting new technologies and business models, and work on novel issues in an exciting, fast-paced environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help manage active IP disputes end-to-end, partnering with internal teams and outside counsel on case strategy, negotiations, and litigation support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assess and triage new off-platform infringement reports, provide enforcement recommendations, and coordinate with outside counsel and brand protection vendors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Draft and execute cease-and-desist letters, DMCA takedown notices, and platform-specific IP complaints, while managing brand protection vendors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee the IP notice-and-takedown program, including partnering with Trust and Safety, Developer Relations, and other cross-functional teams to resolve escalations and align on decisions, refining related legal guidance and policy, and counseling feature launches on Roblox’s IP Platform.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive strategy and execution with respect to on-platform enforcement initiatives and advise on new launches with respect to platform liability issues (e.g., DMCA, EU Digital Services Act).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and update playbooks, templates, and policies to streamline internal IP team projects, portfolio management, and company-wide programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support initiatives and strategies to protect hard IP.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide IP training to cross-functional partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Remain up-to-date on relevant laws, regulations, and evolving industry standards to provide sound legal advice.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tackle any additional incoming questions to the legal team that you are interested in!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You have:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of relevant legal experience, preferably a combination of law firm and in-house experience at a consumer-facing technology company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Active membership in at least one U.S. state bar.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong working knowledge of intellectual property legal issues, including those related to trademark and copyright protection, brand enforcement, customs enforcement, technology licensing, artificial intelligence, and content moderation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous experience counseling on platform liability in the tech industry.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of educating internal stakeholders, translating complex concepts, and advising on risk mitigation strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong business-oriented judgment and the ability to analyze problems, propose solutions, and provide advice that is creative, practical, and legally acceptable, taking into account the needs and objectives of the business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work well with a growing team and desire to seek responsibility and work autonomously. Must be able to manage a diverse and complex workload while maintaining priorities and proactively anticipating issues, particularly in a fast-paced, corporate setting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sense of humor, low ego, and high level of professionalism.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;For roles that are based at our headquarters in San Mateo, CA: The starting base pay for this position is as shown below. The actual base pay is dependent upon a variety of job-related factors such as professional background, training, work experience, location, business needs and market demand. Therefore, in some circumstances, the actual salary could fall outside of this expected range. This pay range is subject to change and may be modified in the future. All full-time employees are also eligible for equity compensation and for benefits as described on &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.roblox.com/total-rewards&quot;&gt;this page&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Annual Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$211,760&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$252,210 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Roles that are based in an office are onsite Tuesday, Wednesday, and Thursday, with optional presence on Monday and Friday (unless otherwise noted).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Roblox provides equal employment opportunities to all employees and applicants for employment and prohibits discrimination and harassment of any type without regard to race, color, religion, age, sex, national origin, disability status, genetics, protected veteran status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state or local laws. Roblox also provides reasonable accommodations to candidates with qualifying disabilities or religious beliefs during the recruiting process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For US based roles only, please note the Company may not be able to employ candidates for this role who have United States work authorization related to certain U.S. visa categories, or support future H-1B sponsorship at this time.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Every day, tens of millions of people come to Roblox to explore, create, play, learn, and connect with friends in 3D immersive digital experiences– all created by our global community of developers and creators.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Roblox, we’re building the tools and platform that empower our community to bring any experience that they can imagine to life. Our vision is to reimagine the way people come together, from anywhere in the world, and on any device.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We’re on a mission to connect a billion people with optimism and civility, and looking for amazing talent to help us get there.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;A career at Roblox means you’ll be working to shape the future of human interaction, solving unique technical challenges at scale, and helping to create safer, more civil shared experiences for everyone.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;As a Law Enforcement Liaison (Kansas), you’ll develop and advance strategic law enforcement and safety relationships with special focus on law enforcement, while also supporting internal platform safety efforts that elevate the Roblox safety ecosystem. The ideal candidate will be a versatile, self-driven, team-player who enjoys context-switching across high-profile initiatives, and is uniquely motivated by Roblox’s mission of connecting a billion people with optimism and civility. From serving as an external representative of Roblox with state and local law enforcement agencies, to collaborating cross-functionally with our Legal &amp;amp; Advocacy, Civility, Safety, Product, and Communications teams (among others), you will have a diverse set of responsibilities in furtherance of assisting law enforcement, educating external stakeholders such as parents and educators on digital safety, and ultimately helping keep users safe on Roblox.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position is remotely based in Kansas and will report to the Senior Manager of US Public Policy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please note: This role requires On-Call support during weekends and holidays, and is expected to include frequent travel. The scope may also require reviewing graphic, controversial, and offensive content in accordance with Roblox’s handling policies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and advance strategic law enforcement relationships with special focus on law enforcement in the State of Kansas, and Midwestern region, while assisting with global outreach as needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate with federal, state, and local law enforcement, including with the Kansas Attorney General’s Office&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plan and execute educational programs for law enforcement agencies and other key external stakeholders (i.e. parent groups and educators) regarding Roblox’s platform safety efforts, including our law enforcement response policies and NCMEC CyberTip initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively identify, monitor, analyze, and internally advise on law enforcement developments affecting Roblox in the State of Kansas and Midwestern region.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Seek to understand and empathetically respond to regional law enforcement concerns, while helping internally codify and scale resultant learnings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Listen to and understand the concerns of Kansas parents, caregivers, and educators regarding the safety of Roblox. You will provide guidance and education that empower these audiences and build confidence in Roblox’s emphasis on product and policy safety, which keeps users safe and healthy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Forge a deep subject-matter expertise of Roblox’s internal and external safety practices, so as to identify, advocate for, and help implement strategic safety enhancements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Draft professional work product – for both internal and external audiences – supported by clear, concise, and multi-sourced platform safety investigations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate and build strong internal relationships across our Legal &amp;amp; Advocacy, Safety, Product, and Communications teams (among others) to help address law enforcement emergencies, platform safety escalations, and comprehensive Roblox undertakings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of work experience in law enforcement, intelligence, government, trust and safety, or an adjacent field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Detailed knowledge of the law enforcement community and related policymakers in the State of Kansas, and Midwestern region, along with current trends and challenges in online safety and policy (particularly child safety and regional-specific considerations).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enthusiasm for and a demonstrated track record of stellar public speaking, short-notice travel, building and maintaining constructive relationships, defining your own work processes, and adding organizational value no matter how small or large the task.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Outstanding communication, leadership, and stakeholder management skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Agility to navigate ambiguity, resilience to overcome obstacles, and the internal drive to concurrently manage multiple high-profile, time-sensitive initiatives in a dynamic environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Unwavering integrity, collegiality, and grit.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Roles that are based in an office are onsite Tuesday, Wednesday, and Thursday, with optional presence on Monday and Friday (unless otherwise noted).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Roblox provides equal employment opportunities to all employees and applicants for employment and prohibits discrimination and harassment of any type without regard to race, color, religion, age, sex, national origin, disability status, genetics, protected veteran status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state or local laws. Roblox also provides reasonable accommodations to candidates with qualifying disabilities or religious beliefs during the recruiting process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For US based roles only, please note the Company may not be able to employ candidates for this role who have United States work authorization related to certain U.S. visa categories, or support future H-1B sponsorship at this time.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Every day, tens of millions of people come to Roblox to explore, create, play, learn, and connect with friends in 3D immersive digital experiences– all created by our global community of developers and creators.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Roblox, we’re building the tools and platform that empower our community to bring any experience that they can imagine to life. Our vision is to reimagine the way people come together, from anywhere in the world, and on any device.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We’re on a mission to connect a billion people with optimism and civility, and looking for amazing talent to help us get there.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;A career at Roblox means you’ll be working to shape the future of human interaction, solving unique technical challenges at scale, and helping to create safer, more civil shared experiences for everyone.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;The Trust and Safety Operations team is focused (ok, maybe obsessed) on scaling Roblox&#39;s Operations organization and transforming our customer experience through our multi-year vision and strategy execution. The team provides support to Roblox&#39;s global players, developers, and advertisers. As a Lead, Product Support Ops on our Safety Ops Team, you’ll be mentor and lead the team that is focused on Escalations, Product Reliability, Process Improvement and Design and plays a critical role in managing and resolving escalations and high-impact incidents affecting our Roblox users and platform. Your team will be responsible for identifying trends, enhancing support processes, improving agent efficiency, and reducing operational costs while maintaining high reliability and service quality.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be reporting to the Trust &amp;amp; Safety India Operations Manager and leading the Support Operations Excellence team, providing coverage across billing, accounts, creator, and adjacent domains. This is a player-coach role, weighted toward leadership. You&#39;ll still go deep on the hardest problems and stay close enough to the work to be a genuine execution expert, but your primary leverage is the team, and you&#39;ll be measured on what they collectively deliver.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Product Support Management (PSM) team is your most important partner. You and your team supply the synthesis, evidence, and prioritization that enable PSM and engineering to fix problems at the source, and you are accountable for the quality of what reaches them.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Will&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead and develop the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage, coach, and grow a team of four Product Support Specialists (i.e. Process Excellence team), owning onboarding, performance, and career development. You’ll set direction and hold the quality of output for the team. Coach them to grow their scope and operate with independence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set clear standards for what good looks like at each level, and give direct, specific, and frequent feedback against them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent the team&#39;s work, constraints, and priorities to leadership and to cross-functional partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Partner with the Product Support Management team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the primary point of contact between the Product Support Specialists team and Product Support Managers (PSM&#39;s), ensuring the issues your team surfaces arrive with the synthesis, evidence, and recommendation needed to act on them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the quality bar for what your team escalates into the PSM and engineering prioritization process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure RCAs are completed, documented, socialized with the right stakeholders, and work with the PSM team to ensure they are translated into changes that prevent recurrence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Step in personally on the highest-stakes and most ambiguous problems, and partner with the PSM team to make the call when the path forward is unclear.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive support health and operational excellence&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Co-own the health of product support across your domains: contact drivers, resolution rates, reopen and escalation rates, deflection performance, CSAT, and where users are getting stuck.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Turn patterns into prioritized action: recurring issues, missing coverage, misleading documentation, and product gaps get surfaced with a recommendation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hold the line on quality standards, tighten workflows and handoffs between support, engineering, and product, and eliminate manual toil through better process and tooling.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support Launches:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Get ahead of launches: make sure upcoming product and policy changes are pressure-tested from a support perspective, and that content, tooling, and agent readiness are in place before users feel the change.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to the successful launch of new support streams and initiatives by providing subject matter expertise, process guidance, and team capacity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with the PSM team to establish a regular feedback loop on support health proactively identifying areas of strength, flagging degrading performance, and driving actionable mitigation plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vendor &amp;amp; Escalation Quality:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with vendor operations (BPO/Tier 1) to establish feedback loops that improve first-contact resolution, reduce bad escalations, and ensure frontline agents are enabled on critical product changes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Knowledge &amp;amp; Support ContentOwn knowledge and scaled support&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Co-own the accuracy/ information within support content that agents depend on along with PSMs, ensuring workflows, policies and guidance are accurate and up to date. Ensure support content which includes but is not limited to,&amp;nbsp; troubleshooting guides, decision trees, structured resolution paths, policy interpretations are clear, current, and reliable for the support agents who use it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Knowledge Management, Training, and Quality teams to align documentation, agent enablement, and quality control with what the data says users actually need.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years in technical support, product support, or a comparable operational role, including significant time at a senior or escalation tier.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct people management experience, including ownership of performance and career development, with a track record of developing individuals and raising the collective performance of a team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A demonstrated track record of independent root cause analysis on complex technical issues, and the judgment to know when to go deep yourself and when to delegate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience owning incident response for high-severity issues, including coordinating cross-functional teams under time pressure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Breadth across multiple support domains, or clear evidence you can get up to speed on an unfamiliar one quickly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written communication. You can explain a nuanced technical failure to an engineer, to a frustrated user, and to leadership, and all three come away clearer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong cross-functional influence without authority.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort with ambiguity. You set direction for your team when the problem space is not yet well defined.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to participate in on-call support when needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A Leader: Your team does better work because of you, and that shows up in their output and their growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analytical: Excited to investigate large, ambiguous problems, and to measure both the problems and the solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proactive problem solver: You anticipate problems and take decisive action rather than waiting for them to escalate to you.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Team-oriented: You lift up your peers and find ways to make the wider organization stronger, not just your own team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data-driven: You use data to identify trends, measure results, and drive decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience owning support content at scale, with real evidence that content changed outcomes (deflection, handle time, resolution quality).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building or scaling a support team through a period of significant growth or change.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience supporting a developer, creator, or partner audience alongside a general consumer base.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with BPO or outsourced support partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Roles that are based in an office are onsite Tuesday, Wednesday, and Thursday, with optional presence on Monday and Friday (unless otherwise noted).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Roblox provides equal employment opportunities to all employees and applicants for employment and prohibits discrimination and harassment of any type without regard to race, color, religion, age, sex, national origin, disability status, genetics, protected veteran status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state or local laws. Roblox also provides reasonable accommodations to candidates with qualifying disabilities or religious beliefs during the recruiting process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For US based roles only, please note the Company may not be able to employ candidates for this role who have United States work authorization related to certain U.S. visa categories, or support future H-1B sponsorship at this time.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Every day, tens of millions of people come to Roblox to explore, create, play, learn, and connect with friends in 3D immersive digital experiences– all created by our global community of developers and creators.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Roblox, we’re building the tools and platform that empower our community to bring any experience that they can imagine to life. Our vision is to reimagine the way people come together, from anywhere in the world, and on any device.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We’re on a mission to connect a billion people with optimism and civility, and looking for amazing talent to help us get there.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;A career at Roblox means you’ll be working to shape the future of human interaction, solving unique technical challenges at scale, and helping to create safer, more civil shared experiences for everyone.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;We’re seeking a detail-oriented and strategically minded Localization Program Manager to lead end-to-end localization efforts for our products. In this role, you will work closely with product managers, engineers, designers, and international teams to deliver world-class localized experiences to our global users. You will manage cross-functional workflows, and ensure quality, timeliness, and cultural relevance in every market we serve.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the i18n and l10n process of features for your group(s) from 0 to 1 by partnering with stakeholders across the organization (Product, Engineering, Design, International and our Community).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be the voice of international users across the company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with product management, engineering, and design teams to integrate localization requirements early in the development cycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and execute localization strategies aligned with product roadmaps and overall business goals. This involves defining localization requirements, scope, and timelines for each product or feature.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guide stakeholders across Roblox to ensure localization best practices are followed and drive efficient execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and refine technical and process issues that affect localized product relevancy, quality, and functionality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with International/localization team to ensure the right resources are in place and all deliveries are completed at the expected standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with localization and product teams to understand potential issues and finding solutions for high-quality multilingual content production&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You have:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A Bachelor’s degree in Linguistics, Localization, International Studies, or related field (or equivalent experience).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of experience in localization or program management, ideally in the tech or SaaS industry.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of localization tools, CAT systems, and translation management platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience localizing products for multiple languages and markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication and collaboration skills, with the ability to work across cultures and time zones&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of internationalization standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly organized and strategic thinker with the ability to prioritize and make decisions with bias towards action, preferably in a high growth environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analytical mindset with the ability to use data to drive decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in English required; additional languages are a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;For roles that are based at our headquarters in San Mateo, CA: The starting base pay for this position is as shown below. The actual base pay is dependent upon a variety of job-related factors such as professional background, training, work experience, location, business needs and market demand. Therefore, in some circumstances, the actual salary could fall outside of this expected range. This pay range is subject to change and may be modified in the future. All full-time employees are also eligible for equity compensation and for benefits as described on &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.roblox.com/total-rewards&quot;&gt;this page&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Annual Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$167,070&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$206,580 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Roles that are based in an office are onsite Tuesday, Wednesday, and Thursday, with optional presence on Monday and Friday (unless otherwise noted).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Roblox provides equal employment opportunities to all employees and applicants for employment and prohibits discrimination and harassment of any type without regard to race, color, religion, age, sex, national origin, disability status, genetics, protected veteran status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state or local laws. Roblox also provides reasonable accommodations to candidates with qualifying disabilities or religious beliefs during the recruiting process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For US based roles only, please note the Company may not be able to employ candidates for this role who have United States work authorization related to certain U.S. visa categories, or support future H-1B sponsorship at this time.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Every day, tens of millions of people come to Roblox to explore, create, play, learn, and connect with friends in 3D immersive digital experiences– all created by our global community of developers and creators.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Roblox, we’re building the tools and platform that empower our community to bring any experience that they can imagine to life. Our vision is to reimagine the way people come together, from anywhere in the world, and on any device.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We’re on a mission to connect a billion people with optimism and civility, and looking for amazing talent to help us get there.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;A career at Roblox means you’ll be working to shape the future of human interaction, solving unique technical challenges at scale, and helping to create safer, more civil shared experiences for everyone.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;As an Editor on Roblox’s Corporate Communications team, you’ll be part of the team creating content to support the company’s goals and narratives in several key areas, including product innovations, AI, safety, creator community, and our users. This hands-on role is pivotal in crafting clear, concise, authentic copy at scale.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will collaborate with Communications and Marketing partners, company executives, product leads, and other business partners to strategically align on compelling messaging and content that tells the world about Roblox. Your unwavering attention to detail, project management skills, collaborative mentality, and passion for clear, persuasive writing will be integral to our mission to connect a billion people with optimism and civility.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Will&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enhance the overall Roblox brand by crafting clear, compelling copy about our products, innovations, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with cross-functional partners across the organization to align on the best strategy and messaging to achieve our goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write for press, user, and creator audiences, and switch easily between them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with cross-functional partners to clarify requirements and deliverables when there is ambiguity or disconnection on the best strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will report directly to the Senior Manager, Editorial&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of professional writing experience with a bachelor&#39;s degree or equivalent experience in English, journalism, communications, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience from the communications, public relations, speechwriting, or journalism industries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Writing samples that showcase clear, compelling consumer-driven content across various topics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practice working with cross-functional teams and stakeholders, accepting feedback and direction gracefully and giving it diplomatically. You are an expert at managing conflicting feedback and bringing stakeholders to alignment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A thoughtful and resilient mindset. You understand that copywriting is iterative and have the ability to operate nimbly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Project management skills: You are comfortable working independently and can track multiple assignments as they move through several rounds of approvals on different deadlines, and still produce high-quality deliverables.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Attention to detail: You make the copy editor’s job easy because you deliver clean copy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;For roles that are based at our headquarters in San Mateo, CA: The starting base pay for this position is as shown below. The actual base pay is dependent upon a variety of job-related factors such as professional background, training, work experience, location, business needs and market demand. Therefore, in some circumstances, the actual salary could fall outside of this expected range. This pay range is subject to change and may be modified in the future. All full-time employees are also eligible for equity compensation and for benefits as described on &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.roblox.com/total-rewards&quot;&gt;this page&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Annual Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$186,620&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$228,550 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Roles that are based in an office are onsite Tuesday, Wednesday, and Thursday, with optional presence on Monday and Friday (unless otherwise noted).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Roblox provides equal employment opportunities to all employees and applicants for employment and prohibits discrimination and harassment of any type without regard to race, color, religion, age, sex, national origin, disability status, genetics, protected veteran status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state or local laws. Roblox also provides reasonable accommodations to candidates with qualifying disabilities or religious beliefs during the recruiting process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For US based roles only, please note the Company may not be able to employ candidates for this role who have United States work authorization related to certain U.S. visa categories, or support future H-1B sponsorship at this time.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Every day, tens of millions of people come to Roblox to explore, create, play, learn, and connect with friends in 3D immersive digital experiences– all created by our global community of developers and creators.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Roblox, we’re building the tools and platform that empower our community to bring any experience that they can imagine to life. Our vision is to reimagine the way people come together, from anywhere in the world, and on any device.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We’re on a mission to connect a billion people with optimism and civility, and looking for amazing talent to help us get there.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;A career at Roblox means you’ll be working to shape the future of human interaction, solving unique technical challenges at scale, and helping to create safer, more civil shared experiences for everyone.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;The Trust and Safety Operations team is focused (ok, maybe obsessed) on scaling Roblox’s Operations organization and transforming our customer experience through our multi-year vision and strategy execution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be reporting to the Trust &amp;amp; Safety India Operations Manager. The team provides support to Roblox’s global players, developers, and advertisers. As a Manager of Product Support Incident management, you’ll be focused on managing the team that manages technical escalations, supports product reliability, process improvement and design along with playing a critical role in managing and resolving escalations and high-impact incidents affecting our Roblox users and platform.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will coordinate across multiple teams to ensure rapid response to minimize the impact on customers and business operations, identifying trends, enhancing support processes, improving agent efficiency, and reducing operational costs while maintaining high reliability and service quality.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role requires participation in a shift rotation to maintain 24/7 operations, which includes on-call duties and weekend coverage.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead and Mentor&lt;/strong&gt;: Manage a high-performing team of Specialists responsible for incident response and technical escalations, providing coaching, development, and performance management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive Issue Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Oversee the end-to-end incident management lifecycle within support operations, ensuring the team meets SLAs for critical and high-severity issues while serving as the final point of escalation for complex issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Incident Management Strategy:&lt;/strong&gt; Coordinate the incident response activities, gather the response team, and set up a virtual command center for communication and collaboration. Due to its potential impact, critical decisions must be made to classify the incident, and be willing to participate in on-call support for incident management issues. Along with this, you will be responsible for providing regular updates and reports to upper management on the status of operations, including performance metrics and any issues encountered.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross Function Collaboration&lt;/strong&gt; - Collaborate with Knowledge Management, Training and Quality Assurance teams to ensure process adherence, identify areas for improvement in support workflows, and implement quality control measures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Partner to Product Support - &lt;/strong&gt;Is a strategic thought partner to product support, aligning on goals and objectives for launch readiness and building in quality escalation and issue management principals to readiness initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Management Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; 10+ years of experience in technical support or operations, with at least &lt;strong&gt;2+ years in a people management&lt;/strong&gt; role, preferably within a high-growth tech environment..&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Advanced Problem Solving:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong ability to translate complex data sets into actionable business strategies. Proficiency in SQL or Python to audit team dashboards and validate data-driven decisions is highly preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Process Improvement:&lt;/strong&gt; Demonstrated success in reducing operating costs and improving Automation Rate/ Contact Rate/CSAT/Quality scores.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Systems Fluency:&lt;/strong&gt; Deep familiarity with the architecture of CRM tools (Zendesk), Jira, and automated ticketing workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Innovative: &lt;/strong&gt;You proactively identify emerging risks and execute on out of the box ideas to achieve goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Strategic Leader:&lt;/strong&gt; You look beyond the immediate incident to solve for the root cause and prevent future friction at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Growth-Oriented:&lt;/strong&gt; You are invested in your team’s success, fostering an inclusive environment that encourages continuous learning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Master Communicator:&lt;/strong&gt; You can distill highly technical incidents into concise &quot;so-what&quot; summaries for non-technical stakeholders and executives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data-Driven&lt;/strong&gt;: Uses data to identify trends, measure results, and drive decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Roles that are based in an office are onsite Tuesday, Wednesday, and Thursday, with optional presence on Monday and Friday (unless otherwise noted).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Roblox provides equal employment opportunities to all employees and applicants for employment and prohibits discrimination and harassment of any type without regard to race, color, religion, age, sex, national origin, disability status, genetics, protected veteran status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state or local laws. Roblox also provides reasonable accommodations to candidates with qualifying disabilities or religious beliefs during the recruiting process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For US based roles only, please note the Company may not be able to employ candidates for this role who have United States work authorization related to certain U.S. visa categories, or support future H-1B sponsorship at this time.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Every day, tens of millions of people come to Roblox to explore, create, play, learn, and connect with friends in 3D immersive digital experiences– all created by our global community of developers and creators.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Roblox, we’re building the tools and platform that empower our community to bring any experience that they can imagine to life. Our vision is to reimagine the way people come together, from anywhere in the world, and on any device.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We’re on a mission to connect a billion people with optimism and civility, and looking for amazing talent to help us get there.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;A career at Roblox means you’ll be working to shape the future of human interaction, solving unique technical challenges at scale, and helping to create safer, more civil shared experiences for everyone.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a versatile marketing leader to manage our marketing engagement across the Middle East, North Africa and Türkiye (MENAT). As our first local marketing person in the region, you will design and execute a comprehensive GTM strategy that accounts for the diverse cultural, economic, and linguistic landscape of MENAT.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be responsible for identifying high-growth clusters, navigating complex regulatory environments, and building a unified brand voice that resonates across multiple borders. Your work will span social, influencers, partner, and event marketing. You will be at the center of all the region&#39;s outbound activity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; United Arab Emirates (plus a few weeks at HQ for an extended orientation)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Holistic Regional Strategy:&lt;/strong&gt; Design a scalable marketing framework that can be adapted for Tier 1 MENAT markets (high volume/established) and Tier 2/3 markets (high growth).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Localized Content Ecosystem:&lt;/strong&gt; Oversee the &quot;transcreation&quot; and localization of all marketing assets. While English is our core working language, you will ensure our brand voice translates with native-level nuance across key MENAT regions, leveraging your fluent Arabic skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agile GTM Execution:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead product launches across MENAT, prioritizing markets based on data, barriers to entry, and localized product-market fit.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Border Community &amp;amp; Influencer Growth:&lt;/strong&gt; Leverage regional social media and platform trends to build a loyal community through targeted influencer partnerships and localized channels (Instagram, TikTok, LinkedIn, etc.).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Policy &amp;amp; Comms Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Work closely with legal and policy teams to navigate the varied regulatory landscapes of MENAT, ensuring absolute compliance with local data privacy standards relevant to the MENAT region and local data privacy standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Event &amp;amp; Ecosystem Strategy:&lt;/strong&gt; Develop locally relevant events and community initiatives across key priority MENAT markets, while also participating in existing industry events that support relationship building, market understanding and ecosystem growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Market Partnerships:&lt;/strong&gt; Build and develop trusted partnerships with brands, NGOs, across key MENAT markets to strengthen local credibility, relevance and long-term growth, while deepening engagement with creators, industry stakeholders and broader market ecosystems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You’ll Have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
