&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Every day, tens of millions of people come to Roblox to explore, create, play, learn, and connect with friends in 3D immersive digital experiences– all created by our global community of developers and creators.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Roblox, we’re building the tools and platform that empower our community to bring any experience that they can imagine to life. Our vision is to reimagine the way people come together, from anywhere in the world, and on any device.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We’re on a mission to connect a billion people with optimism and civility, and looking for amazing talent to help us get there.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;A career at Roblox means you’ll be working to shape the future of human interaction, solving unique technical challenges at scale, and helping to create safer, more civil shared experiences for everyone.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Principal Network Engineer, you will work cross-functionally to plan the growth of Roblox’s global production network to support rapid user growth. In this role, you are responsible for Engineering and Architecture of Roblox Backbone and Edge Network. You will ensure that we are making the right investments with our global expansion to provide a great experience for all our users worldwide. We run services and a hosting platform with some unique complexities, so this role is an opportunity for the experienced network engineer to take on new challenges in addition to applying their existing expertise.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a Principle Engineer for Roblox&#39;s Backbone Network.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive future design, deployment, and operations for Roblox’s large-scale Network Infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage in design, qualification, and validation of new technologies, and ensure new technologies are deployable at scale and are safely operable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with the Network Tooling Team to automate workflows and improve telemetry, observability, and alerting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with net tools to automate existing workflows and improve our telemetry and alerting framework.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in on-call rotation to support the global network infrastructure 24x7.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of work experience responsible for designing, deploying and operating large-scale networks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of work experience designing and managing large scale Backbone and Edge Networks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience configuring and troubleshooting routing and switching protocols (BGP, IS-IS, MPLS, RSVP-TE,).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of network protocols (TCP/UDP, DHCP, DNS) and experience with IPv4 and IPv6.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in a multi-vendor environment with hands-on experience with networking hardware.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in at least one programming language like Python, Go, C/C++ is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of successful collaboration with multidisciplinary teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;For roles that are based at our data center in &lt;strong&gt;Ashburn, VA&lt;/strong&gt;: The starting base pay for this position is as shown below. The actual base pay is dependent upon a variety of job-related factors such as professional background, training, work experience, location, business needs and market demand. Therefore, in some circumstances, the actual salary could fall outside of this expected range. This pay range is subject to change and may be modified in the future.&amp;nbsp; All full-time employees are also eligible for equity compensation and for benefits as described on &lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.roblox.com/total-rewards&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;this page&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Annual Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$265,730&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$320,890 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Roles that are based in an office are onsite Tuesday, Wednesday, and Thursday, with optional presence on Monday and Friday (unless otherwise noted).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Roblox provides equal employment opportunities to all employees and applicants for employment and prohibits discrimination and harassment of any type without regard to race, color, religion, age, sex, national origin, disability status, genetics, protected veteran status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state or local laws. Roblox also provides reasonable accommodations to candidates with qualifying disabilities or religious beliefs during the recruiting process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For US based roles only, please note the Company may not be able to employ candidates for this role who have United States work authorization related to certain U.S. visa categories, or support future H-1B sponsorship at this time.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Every day, tens of millions of people come to Roblox to explore, create, play, learn, and connect with friends in 3D immersive digital experiences– all created by our global community of developers and creators.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Roblox, we’re building the tools and platform that empower our community to bring any experience that they can imagine to life. Our vision is to reimagine the way people come together, from anywhere in the world, and on any device.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We’re on a mission to connect a billion people with optimism and civility, and looking for amazing talent to help us get there.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;A career at Roblox means you’ll be working to shape the future of human interaction, solving unique technical challenges at scale, and helping to create safer, more civil shared experiences for everyone.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Roblox runs a global scale network with a number of data centers and public clouds to provide services to millions of users, and creates a broad threat landscape. As a Principal Security Software Engineer on the Network Security pod, you will help shape and implement our network security strategy and controls. You&#39;ll have a big impact while collaborating with security and cross-functional teams to secure our networks, protect our services and platforms.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you’ll work closely with other people in the Information Security (InfoSec) team as well as partner with multiple Roblox infrastructure engineering teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;You will&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify security vulnerabilities &amp;amp; gaps in our network infrastructure, propose solutions and drive engineering effort for implementation, partner with our infrastructure teams on improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, develop, and optimize novel solutions &amp;amp; systems using your software engineering skills and system thinking, to protect Roblox’s networks from external threats and internal risks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide design reviews &amp;amp; guidelines from network security perspective for Roblox’s tools, services, and platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;You have&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;8+ years&lt;/strong&gt;: of relevant professional experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Programming Proficiency:&lt;/strong&gt; Able to write high-performance code for large scale distributed services with at least one programming language such as Golang or C++, and you are eager to learn new languages and technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hands-on experience: &lt;/strong&gt;Designing and building production level services in fields of networking and security, such as L4/L7 network proxies, load balancers, IDS/IPS, firewalls, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In-depth knowledge of: &lt;/strong&gt;Network routings and protocols (TCP/UDP, DHCP, DNS, etc.), attack vectors, techniques, and remediations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience with:&lt;/strong&gt; advanced packet processing technologies and frameworks, such as DPDK, eBPF, is a big plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;You are&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborative: &lt;/strong&gt;You love working with your direct team and cross-functional partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Self-driving Software Engineer&lt;/strong&gt;: You’re well-versed in the depths of networks or security, with hands-on experience in building high performance and reliable systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Comfortable with ambiguity: &lt;/strong&gt;You can gather data and make informed decisions when there is no clear answer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Eager to solve hard problems: &lt;/strong&gt;You challenge the status quo when it no longer makes sense, and don’t shy away from big challenges.&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;For roles that are based at our headquarters in San Mateo, CA: The starting base pay for this position is as shown below. The actual base pay is dependent upon a variety of job-related factors such as professional background, training, work experience, location, business needs and market demand. Therefore, in some circumstances, the actual salary could fall outside of this expected range. This pay range is subject to change and may be modified in the future. All full-time employees are also eligible for equity compensation and for benefits as described on &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.roblox.com/total-rewards&quot;&gt;this page&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Annual Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$326,060&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$385,050 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Roles that are based in an office are onsite Tuesday, Wednesday, and Thursday, with optional presence on Monday and Friday (unless otherwise noted).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Roblox provides equal employment opportunities to all employees and applicants for employment and prohibits discrimination and harassment of any type without regard to race, color, religion, age, sex, national origin, disability status, genetics, protected veteran status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state or local laws. Roblox also provides reasonable accommodations to candidates with qualifying disabilities or religious beliefs during the recruiting process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For US based roles only, please note the Company may not be able to employ candidates for this role who have United States work authorization related to certain U.S. visa categories, or support future H-1B sponsorship at this time.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Every day, tens of millions of people come to Roblox to explore, create, play, learn, and connect with friends in 3D immersive digital experiences– all created by our global community of developers and creators.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Roblox, we’re building the tools and platform that empower our community to bring any experience that they can imagine to life. Our vision is to reimagine the way people come together, from anywhere in the world, and on any device.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We’re on a mission to connect a billion people with optimism and civility, and looking for amazing talent to help us get there.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;A career at Roblox means you’ll be working to shape the future of human interaction, solving unique technical challenges at scale, and helping to create safer, more civil shared experiences for everyone.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Roblox Premium is the subscription product that gives our most engaged users an upgraded experience on the platform.It is one of the biggest growth opportunities in our economy. As Principal Product Manager for Subscriptions and Revenue Growth, you will own the long-term strategy and roadmap for subscriptions: what subscribers get, why they join, why they stay, and how the subscription business compounds over time. You will work across nearly every team at Roblox, and directly with our developer community, to build benefits that only a subscription can deliver. This is a player-coach role for a product leader who wants scope and influence, and who is energized by owning a business outcome end to end.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is based in San Mateo, CA (no remote option) and reports to the Sr. Director Product, Economy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;You will:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the long-term strategy and roadmap for Roblox subscriptions, including the subscriber value proposition, tiering, pricing, and the multi-year vision for where the product goes next.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive acquisition and retention as a business owner : grow the subscriber base, improve conversion through the funnel, reduce churn, and expand internationally.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and ship new subscriber benefits that meaningfully upgrade the experience, partnering with teams across the company to bring their surfaces and features into the subscription.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work directly with developers and creators to build developer-led subscription offerings, making it compelling for them to create value that is exclusive to or enhanced for subscribers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and run a rigorous growth experimentation program&amp;nbsp; and hold the bar on statistical and decision-making quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the metrics and business impact of subscriptions, from subscriber penetration and retention cohorts through to bookings, and communicate that story to executive leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set the product standard for the broader team, mentoring other PMs and raising the quality of strategy, writing, and execution across the group.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;You have:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of product management experience, with deep expertise in consumer subscription and growth products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience operating at principal or staff level: setting direction for a large, cross-company initiative and driving it through teams you do not own.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep growth experimentation expertise, including A/B testing methodology, funnel analysis, cohort and lifecycle measurement, and knowing the limits of what a test can tell you.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A technical approach: delving into product, platform, and implementation details, and the ability to engage engineering on scalable, extensible solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A data-driven approach: proficiency identifying, defining, tracking, and acting upon metrics, and working with engineering and analytics on instrumentation and monitoring.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional written and verbal communication: the ability to convey strategy, priorities, and tradeoffs at the 30,000-foot level as well as produce clear, detailed product specifications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with marketplace, platform, or creator-economy products, or with subscriptions in a two-sided ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A Bachelor&#39;s degree or equivalent experience in a technical, business, or related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;You are:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An entrepreneurial product leader who proposes high-reaching ideas and puts them into action.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Persuasive across organizational lines. You galvanize and inspire teams you have no authority over.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable with strong opinions loosely held, and willing to make calls with limited information.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Obsessed with the subscriber experience and equally obsessed with the numbers behind it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on, creative, data-driven, and attentive to detail.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;For roles that are based at our headquarters in San Mateo, CA: The starting base pay for this position is as shown below. The actual base pay is dependent upon a variety of job-related factors such as professional background, training, work experience, location, business needs and market demand. Therefore, in some circumstances, the actual salary could fall outside of this expected range. This pay range is subject to change and may be modified in the future. All full-time employees are also eligible for equity compensation and for benefits as described on &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.roblox.com/total-rewards&quot;&gt;this page&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Annual Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$330,950&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$383,120 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Roles that are based in an office are onsite Tuesday, Wednesday, and Thursday, with optional presence on Monday and Friday (unless otherwise noted).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Roblox provides equal employment opportunities to all employees and applicants for employment and prohibits discrimination and harassment of any type without regard to race, color, religion, age, sex, national origin, disability status, genetics, protected veteran status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state or local laws. Roblox also provides reasonable accommodations to candidates with qualifying disabilities or religious beliefs during the recruiting process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For US based roles only, please note the Company may not be able to employ candidates for this role who have United States work authorization related to certain U.S. visa categories, or support future H-1B sponsorship at this time.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Every day, tens of millions of people come to Roblox to explore, create, play, learn, and connect with friends in 3D immersive digital experiences– all created by our global community of developers and creators.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Roblox, we’re building the tools and platform that empower our community to bring any experience that they can imagine to life. Our vision is to reimagine the way people come together, from anywhere in the world, and on any device.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We’re on a mission to connect a billion people with optimism and civility, and looking for amazing talent to help us get there.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;A career at Roblox means you’ll be working to shape the future of human interaction, solving unique technical challenges at scale, and helping to create safer, more civil shared experiences for everyone.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Unlike anywhere else in AI right now, Roblox is building AI for creation. The mission of our Foundation AI team is to put generative AI in the hands of millions of creators. Last year, we shipped our first 3D foundation model, which turns text prompt into a production-ready 3D object. We&#39;re now pushing further into multi-modal input, like image, video, and 3D assets, and toward 4D, fully interactive worlds, all while developers keep full control of their game rules and physics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Creators use these models to build everything from a single 3D object to an entire playable world, reaching tens of millions of people every day. That end-to-end loop, from a creator&#39;s first prompt to a player&#39;s first moment inside an experience, is what makes this space different. The story of what these tools can do, and where they&#39;re headed, is still largely untold.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a world-class &lt;strong&gt;Senior Product Marketing Manager&lt;/strong&gt; to define how Roblox communicates the future of AI-powered creation. This is a high-visibility role requiring a blend of technical fluency, narrative craft, and the cross-functional instincts to move quickly in one of the most dynamic spaces in the industry. You will be embedded with our Foundation AI product and engineering teams, earning fluency at the intersection of deep technical innovation and a creator community that cares intensely about what gets built. You will build the brief, run the launch, and shape how millions of creators understand what is possible today and where we’re headed.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is based in our San Mateo, CA Headquarters on a hybrid model, in-person three days a week, and reports into the Director of Creator Product Marketing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Will:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the positioning and messaging for our Foundation AI products and turn technical capability into narratives that earn trust and drive action with creators.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use the tools you are marketing. Hands-on product familiarity produces better stories than any spec sheet.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay ahead of the AI landscape. Develop a point of view on where Roblox sits and articulate what makes AI-native creation genuinely distinct.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thread individual launches into a larger arc. In a fast-shipping environment, you build the through-line that shows creators where we are going and why it matters.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Move fast and bring people with you. You have the instincts to act quickly and the relationship skills to keep partners aligned without slowing down.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Close the loop between market and product. You bring creator sentiment and market signals into roadmap conversations just as naturally as you build the external narrative from them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Think beyond launch day. You are energized by driving adoption and building the sustained education that turns a feature into a habit.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Have:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of Product Marketing experience at a high-growth technology company, with a track record in developer tools, AI products, or technical platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Genuine curiosity about AI. You follow the space, have opinions about it, and are comfortable enough to use it, experiment with it, and explain it without oversimplifying.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Narrative instinct. You find the “so what” in a dense technical briefing and make complex work legible and worth caring about.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional written and verbal communication skills, with the range to adapt your voice for a developer community, an exec, or a creative brief.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to drive cross-functional alignment. You quarterback GTM across Comms, Legal, DevRel, and Creative and keep things moving without losing people.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep creator empathy and a collaborative nature. You build trust with engineering and product partners because you take their work as seriously as they do.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;For roles that are based at our headquarters in San Mateo, CA: The starting base pay for this position is as shown below. The actual base pay is dependent upon a variety of job-related factors such as professional background, training, work experience, location, business needs and market demand. Therefore, in some circumstances, the actual salary could fall outside of this expected range. This pay range is subject to change and may be modified in the future. All full-time employees are also eligible for equity compensation and for benefits as described on &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.roblox.com/total-rewards&quot;&gt;this page&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Annual Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$263,710&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$300,940 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Roles that are based in an office are onsite Tuesday, Wednesday, and Thursday, with optional presence on Monday and Friday (unless otherwise noted).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Roblox provides equal employment opportunities to all employees and applicants for employment and prohibits discrimination and harassment of any type without regard to race, color, religion, age, sex, national origin, disability status, genetics, protected veteran status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state or local laws. Roblox also provides reasonable accommodations to candidates with qualifying disabilities or religious beliefs during the recruiting process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For US based roles only, please note the Company may not be able to employ candidates for this role who have United States work authorization related to certain U.S. visa categories, or support future H-1B sponsorship at this time.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Every day, tens of millions of people come to Roblox to explore, create, play, learn, and connect with friends in 3D immersive digital experiences– all created by our global community of developers and creators.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Roblox, we’re building the tools and platform that empower our community to bring any experience that they can imagine to life. Our vision is to reimagine the way people come together, from anywhere in the world, and on any device.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We’re on a mission to connect a billion people with optimism and civility, and looking for amazing talent to help us get there.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;A career at Roblox means you’ll be working to shape the future of human interaction, solving unique technical challenges at scale, and helping to create safer, more civil shared experiences for everyone.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;As a Principal Site Reliability Operations Engineer on the Reliability Team, you will manage production incidents and improve Roblox&#39;s incident processes while reporting to the Senior Operations Manager. You will maintain reliability service-level objectives, drive incidents tenaciously to resolution, and work with service teams towards appropriate action items during the incident postmortem process. If you are passionate about maintaining uptime in a complex distributed environment full of continuous change, you&#39;ll be right at home with our Reliability team.You will report to the Senior Manager, Reliability Response.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and manage production incidents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate cross-functionally to troubleshoot and resolve sophisticated technical challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guide the implementation of incident management processes and procedures, ensuring fast and effective responses to minimize impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continually monitor system health, performance and capacity, proactively addressing potential issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct comprehensive post-mortem analysis to ascertain the root cause of incidents and formulate corrective measures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute substantially to the design and enhancement of system architecture to boost reliability and performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage coding skills to automate daily routine tasks and enhance system efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve in the Incident Manager On-Call rotation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor junior team members.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least 8+ years of experience in a comparable role within a Site Reliability Team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced knowledge of systems and network infrastructure protocols.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability in managing, troubleshooting, and resolving incidents in distributed environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience solving problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An ability to distill complex technical issues into clear and concise language.&lt;/li&gt;
