&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A great communicator; you are able to explain complex systems clearly to stakeholders and fellow engineers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to operate in potentially ambiguous circumstances during a production incident.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiar with the interactions of services in a distributed system.&lt;/li&gt;
