&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;A career at Roblox means you’ll be working to shape the future of human interaction, solving unique technical challenges at scale, and helping to create safer, more civil shared experiences for everyone.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;3&quot;&gt;As a Principal Software Engineer on the Avatar Personalization team, you will use the Roblox game engine to build features that push the boundaries of our avatar technology, and build creative systems that make Roblox avatars simple and delightful to use. You will tackle the biggest architectural projects, provide technical leadership, and coordinate with teams across Roblox to build systems used by tens of millions of monthly players and developers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot;&gt;You are passionate about building outstanding systems and APIs in the Roblox game engine, enhancing avatar features, and enriching customization systems for Roblox players and developers. You&#39;ll work with Avatar technologies such as animation, clothing, hair, and shading. Experience in game or film development is especially translatable into this team and role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;You Will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;6,0,0&quot;&gt;Implement groundbreaking features in Roblox game engine to build the best avatar system in the world&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;6,1,0&quot;&gt;Build APIs for Roblox developers enabling in-experience creation of Roblox Avatars from scratch&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;6,2,0&quot;&gt;Enhance avatar fidelity and uniqueness on Roblox&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;6,3,0&quot;&gt;Use the Roblox game engine to build excellent vertical applications for multiple platforms (mobile, tablet, PC, and console)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;6,4,0&quot;&gt;Refactor and improve our existing codebase, and establish architectural standards for system reliability, performance, and test coverage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;6,5,0&quot;&gt;Work with numerous teams to help build the world&#39;s best user generated gaming platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement systems in a combination of C++ and Lua&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;You Have:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;8,0,0&quot;&gt;8+ years of professional experience working on a consumer-facing game engine and/or game application&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;8,1,0&quot;&gt;Proficiency with C++, 3D math, data structures, algorithms, and networking&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;8,2,0&quot;&gt;Experience working on character building and customization systems, editors, and content creation tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;8,3,0&quot;&gt;Experience building online console or mobile game titles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;8,4,0&quot;&gt;Experience with game or film character systems such as animation, rigid-body or cloth/hair physics, or shading&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
