&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A software engineer with 10+ years of experience with Game networking coming from a Game Engine/Studio&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A deep understanding of Network Stack with a passion for working with open source&lt;/li&gt;
