&lt;li&gt;Successfully deployed a high-quality, multi-service distributed system at scale with low costs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with the challenges of working at scale and on constrained platforms like consoles or mobile devices.&lt;/li&gt;
