&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SME on Law:&lt;/strong&gt; Provide subject-matter expertise and guidance on the evolving global security and privacy legal landscape, including legislation, regulations, enforcement actions, and best practices,&amp;nbsp; translating analysis into clear, concise, and actionable guidance to both legal and security teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Incident Response Engagement:&lt;/strong&gt; Engage with the Detection and Response and Global Security teams during incidents. Provide legal guidance throughout the incident, including during verification, triage, containment, remediation, post-mortem, table-top exercises, counseling internal stakeholders throughout the incident lifecycle, reporting to regulators, and notifying customers to meet our global obligations.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Security Compliance Support: &lt;/strong&gt;Own and deliver complex, cross-functional cybersecurity legal initiatives end-to-end, including AI and agentic-AI governance, new regulatory regimes, major incident response improvements, with clear milestones, stakeholder alignment, and measurable outcomes. Continuously improve incident response policies and playbooks that meet the standards of applicable global data privacy and security laws.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Security Team Support: &lt;/strong&gt;Embed within security pods as a trusted partner and go-to legal resource for regular expertise, insights, guidance, and support to different security teams, including Application Security, GRC, Privacy Engineering, Global Security, and Infrastructure/Platform teams, developing a working understanding of Roblox’s architecture, data flows, and operational constraints.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Legal Advice:&lt;/strong&gt; Provide subject matter expertise in privacy and security and support to cross-functional legal advocacy teams, including corporate, employment, compliance, policy, regulatory, product, privacy, and commercial.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years of data security, data privacy, data protection and governance experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise in US and global data security and protection laws and regulations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of security regulations, laws, and frameworks, such as GDPR, NIS2, CRA, CCPA, COPPA, CA SB 553, NIST CSF, and PCI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with Information Security teams, including Incident Response, Application Security and Governance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with security incidents including, breaches, breach reporting to regulators, customer notifications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience implementing global data protection and security requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Training at a major national law firm; in-house experience a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Active membership in at least one U.S. state bar; California Bar admission preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent business-oriented judgment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience operating as a senior individual contributor in a fast-paced technology company, driving complex, cross-functional programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of taking ambiguous, cross-functional projects from concept to delivery, using strong project management skills to drive accountability and hit deadlines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional written and verbal communication skills, including the ability to “speak the language of the business” (not the law firm) and tailor messaging to executives, engineers, and operations teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working familiarity with large-scale, modern infrastructure (e.g., cloud platforms, microservices, observability, incident management tooling) sufficient to understand how technical architectures influence legal risk and incident response.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;For roles that are based at our headquarters in San Mateo, CA: The starting base pay for this position is as shown below. The actual base pay is dependent upon a variety of job-related factors such as professional background, training, work experience, location, business needs and market demand. Therefore, in some circumstances, the actual salary could fall outside of this expected range. This pay range is subject to change and may be modified in the future. All full-time employees are also eligible for equity compensation and for benefits as described on &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.roblox.com/total-rewards&quot;&gt;this page&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Annual Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$168,100&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$211,760 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Roles that are based in an office are onsite Tuesday, Wednesday, and Thursday, with optional presence on Monday and Friday (unless otherwise noted).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Roblox provides equal employment opportunities to all employees and applicants for employment and prohibits discrimination and harassment of any type without regard to race, color, religion, age, sex, national origin, disability status, genetics, protected veteran status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state or local laws. Roblox also provides reasonable accommodations to candidates with qualifying disabilities or religious beliefs during the recruiting process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For US based roles only, please note the Company may not be able to employ candidates for this role who have United States work authorization related to certain U.S. visa categories, or support future H-1B sponsorship at this time.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Every day, tens of millions of people come to Roblox to explore, create, play, learn, and connect with friends in 3D immersive digital experiences– all created by our global community of developers and creators.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Roblox, we’re building the tools and platform that empower our community to bring any experience that they can imagine to life. Our vision is to reimagine the way people come together, from anywhere in the world, and on any device.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We’re on a mission to connect a billion people with optimism and civility, and looking for amazing talent to help us get there.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;A career at Roblox means you’ll be working to shape the future of human interaction, solving unique technical challenges at scale, and helping to create safer, more civil shared experiences for everyone.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;As a Specialist on the Proactive Moderation Operations team, you will carry out the day-to-day work of our proactive human moderation efforts. You will own multiple moderation cases at a time, taking each from ticket creation through moderation, QA, and golden labeling. You will build deep expertise in our proactive moderation tooling and processes, apply rapid and accurate labels to user-generated content, and help interpret grey-area policies and detect and moderate new abuse trends. Acting as an expert judge on every case you handle, you will weigh tradeoffs between false positive rates, speed, and urgency, and surface bugs, feature limitations, and feature requests that help improve overall operations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will report to the Lead, Proactive Moderation Operations. The role is based out of our Gurugram, India office and follows a rotational on-call work schedule.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage multiple moderation cases at once and own each one end to end, including creating moderation tickets, moderating those tickets, conducting QA, golden labeling, reporting on the latest trends and data, and more&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shift fluidly between different policy violation areas as priorities and abuse trends change&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay current on developing, sensitive real-world events and factor that context into your case management and moderation decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply rapid and accurate labels to user-generated content, serving as an expert judge who weighs tradeoffs between false positive rates, speed, and urgency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Execute and help refine the workflows our content safety moderation response teams use to ensure timely and effective moderation of user-generated content&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop deep, hands-on expertise in our proactive moderation tooling and processes, and help interpret grey-area policies as new situations arise&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively hunt for threats and undetected abuse by leveraging internal data sets, open-source intelligence, and third-parties&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with third-parties and cross-functional teammates to conduct effective, metrics-driven content moderation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Surface bugs, feature limitations, and feature requests, and collaborate on solutions that improve operations and enhance the safety of our users&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consistently meet your quality and throughput targets, and use data to inform your moderation decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This role requires on-call work at weekends on a rotational basis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This role involves exposure to graphic and/or objectionable content&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in business, operations, or a related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience in content moderation, trust &amp;amp; safety, or a similar field, ideally with exposure to content safety moderation workflows and threat hunting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong attention to detail and sound judgment, with the ability to apply policies consistently and accurately under time pressure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience following and improving processes that support operational efficiency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort using data to inform day-to-day decision-making&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong collaboration skills, with the ability to work with cross-functional teams, specifically product, engineering, and BPO workforces&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical and critical thinking skills, with the ability to conduct deep-dive investigations, and make sound, evidence-based decisions in ambiguous and fast-paced environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Roles that are based in an office are onsite Tuesday, Wednesday, and Thursday, with optional presence on Monday and Friday (unless otherwise noted).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Roblox provides equal employment opportunities to all employees and applicants for employment and prohibits discrimination and harassment of any type without regard to race, color, religion, age, sex, national origin, disability status, genetics, protected veteran status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state or local laws. Roblox also provides reasonable accommodations to candidates with qualifying disabilities or religious beliefs during the recruiting process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For US based roles only, please note the Company may not be able to employ candidates for this role who have United States work authorization related to certain U.S. visa categories, or support future H-1B sponsorship at this time.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Every day, tens of millions of people come to Roblox to explore, create, play, learn, and connect with friends in 3D immersive digital experiences– all created by our global community of developers and creators.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Roblox, we’re building the tools and platform that empower our community to bring any experience that they can imagine to life. Our vision is to reimagine the way people come together, from anywhere in the world, and on any device.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We’re on a mission to connect a billion people with optimism and civility, and looking for amazing talent to help us get there.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;A career at Roblox means you’ll be working to shape the future of human interaction, solving unique technical challenges at scale, and helping to create safer, more civil shared experiences for everyone.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Roblox, the Roblox Operating System (ROS) team builds the intelligent, integrated platforms that power the productivity and collaboration of every Builder across the company. As a Product Designer, you will shape and scale the next generation of our internal tool ecosystem. You won&#39;t just be designing dashboards; you will be pioneering intuitive, self-service tools and AI-assisted workflows that enable our teams to seamlessly manage massive data analytics, knowledge discovery, and open platform integrations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll partner deeply with product managers and engineers to understand highly technical needs, translating dense data primitives and complex workflows into elegant, unified experiences from discovery through launch. Your work will empower our internal teams to move with speed and confidence, reducing their cognitive load through intelligent, agentic workflows within our Open Platform and AI enablement initiatives. Crucially, you will bring an uncompromising level of design craft to the enterprise layer — proving that the world&#39;s most powerful internal platforms can also be beautifully executed and intuitive.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You have a systematic approach to design, a proven ability to simplify the complex, and a passion for defining new AI-driven interaction patterns across our interconnected suite of tools. You thrive in the space where deep technical empathy meets high-fidelity execution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Transform the Builder experience: Lead end-to-end UX for core productivity and collaboration surfaces, removing friction from day-to-day workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Unify the ecosystem: Transform how discrete internal tools come together into one cohesive platform — connecting work tracking, growth and performance, and knowledge discovery into everyday workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pioneer agentic UX: Define new interaction patterns for LLM-powered, agentic workflows — designing the handoff between Builder intent and AI execution, and the trust, control, and proactive insight that make it work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bridge design and engineering: Partner with product leaders, engineering, and data scientists, navigating complex technical and data constraints while consistently upleveling experience quality and design integrity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set the craft bar: Own high-visibility dashboards and leadership-facing experiences, turning dense operational signals into clear, actionable insight.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years of product design experience solving complex, systems-level problems in highly technical enterprise environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Domain expertise in data analytics, enterprise ecosystems, internal productivity platforms, or developer tooling — comfort translating organizational workflows and data primitives into unified, self-service experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI/LLM design experience: defining interfaces for agentic workflows, Work Intelligence platforms, or intelligent automation, with a grasp of user trust, proactive insight, and control.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expert command of modern design stacks: high fluency in complex Figma environments&amp;nbsp; and AI-augmented workflows used as a force multiplier for iteration and craft.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An obsessive dedication to craft: every pixel matters, and you refine until the experience feels inevitable and effortless.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong cross-functional collaboration across large-scale, ambiguous initiatives spanning multiple teams from concept through launch.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;For roles that are based at our headquarters in San Mateo, CA: The starting base pay for this position is as shown below. The actual base pay is dependent upon a variety of job-related factors such as professional background, training, work experience, location, business needs and market demand. Therefore, in some circumstances, the actual salary could fall outside of this expected range. This pay range is subject to change and may be modified in the future. All full-time employees are also eligible for equity compensation and for benefits as described on &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.roblox.com/total-rewards&quot;&gt;this page&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Annual Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$176,940&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$214,710 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Roles that are based in an office are onsite Tuesday, Wednesday, and Thursday, with optional presence on Monday and Friday (unless otherwise noted).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Roblox provides equal employment opportunities to all employees and applicants for employment and prohibits discrimination and harassment of any type without regard to race, color, religion, age, sex, national origin, disability status, genetics, protected veteran status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state or local laws. Roblox also provides reasonable accommodations to candidates with qualifying disabilities or religious beliefs during the recruiting process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For US based roles only, please note the Company may not be able to employ candidates for this role who have United States work authorization related to certain U.S. visa categories, or support future H-1B sponsorship at this time.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Every day, tens of millions of people come to Roblox to explore, create, play, learn, and connect with friends in 3D immersive digital experiences– all created by our global community of developers and creators.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Roblox, we’re building the tools and platform that empower our community to bring any experience that they can imagine to life. Our vision is to reimagine the way people come together, from anywhere in the world, and on any device.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We’re on a mission to connect a billion people with optimism and civility, and looking for amazing talent to help us get there.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;A career at Roblox means you’ll be working to shape the future of human interaction, solving unique technical challenges at scale, and helping to create safer, more civil shared experiences for everyone.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Creator Services on Roblox enable creators to scale their games to larger worlds and audiences. As a Product Designer on the team, you will aim to transform complex, backend-heavy technical infrastructure into intuitive, high-craft user experiences for our global creator community. Some of these end user facing tools include the Translation portal, Server Management, and Extended Services.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a unique high technical empathy design role. You will be pioneering the UI/UX for the next generation of Roblox’s Cloud Services and foundational developer tools. You will work in a tight-knit model with Product and Engineering, specifically partnering with the team responsible for our APIs to ensure that the power of our data platform is accessible, scalable, and elegant.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will design and build end-to-end UX journeys, working collaboratively with other team leads across product, research, data science, and engineering. You will bring previous relevant experience or become a domain expert through this role, understanding user needs and designing innovative design solutions. You will report to the Senior Design Manager for Creator Experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Craft end-to-end experiences, define UX strategy, and bring in new perspectives and deep industry knowledge.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deeply care about craft by creating visually compelling and intuitive user interfaces across devices for a global audience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with product and engineering to drive design discussions and proactively provide insights, in addition to design specs and partnering on implementation to deliver a high-quality, high-craft experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage analytics and user feedback to identify pain points and implement data-driven improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Present design journeys and strategies at the team and group level.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience (5+ years) in product design, with a strong track record of delivery creator and game platform tooling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A portfolio demonstrating exceptional interaction and visual design craft, paired with strong product, systems, and strategic thinking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong proficiency in design tooling, such as Figma, and confidence in AI prototyping and concepting in everyday workflows in their designs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;End-to-end systems thinking that advocates for holistic and connected user experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to navigate ambiguity, influence cross-functional decisions, and balance user needs with business goals and technical constraints.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Skills to problem solve and think critically, and develop a principled approach towards a high quality solution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A passion for immersive platforms, gaming, user-generated content, or tools that enable people to create and express themselves.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;For roles that are based at our headquarters in San Mateo, CA: The starting base pay for this position is as shown below. The actual base pay is dependent upon a variety of job-related factors such as professional background, training, work experience, location, business needs and market demand. Therefore, in some circumstances, the actual salary could fall outside of this expected range. This pay range is subject to change and may be modified in the future. All full-time employees are also eligible for equity compensation and for benefits as described on &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.roblox.com/total-rewards&quot;&gt;this page&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Annual Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$176,940&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$214,710 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Roles that are based in an office are onsite Tuesday, Wednesday, and Thursday, with optional presence on Monday and Friday (unless otherwise noted).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Roblox provides equal employment opportunities to all employees and applicants for employment and prohibits discrimination and harassment of any type without regard to race, color, religion, age, sex, national origin, disability status, genetics, protected veteran status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state or local laws. Roblox also provides reasonable accommodations to candidates with qualifying disabilities or religious beliefs during the recruiting process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For US based roles only, please note the Company may not be able to employ candidates for this role who have United States work authorization related to certain U.S. visa categories, or support future H-1B sponsorship at this time.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Every day, tens of millions of people come to Roblox to explore, create, play, learn, and connect with friends in 3D immersive digital experiences– all created by our global community of developers and creators.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Roblox, we’re building the tools and platform that empower our community to bring any experience that they can imagine to life. Our vision is to reimagine the way people come together, from anywhere in the world, and on any device.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We’re on a mission to connect a billion people with optimism and civility, and looking for amazing talent to help us get there.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;A career at Roblox means you’ll be working to shape the future of human interaction, solving unique technical challenges at scale, and helping to create safer, more civil shared experiences for everyone.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot;&gt;Roblox is reimagining the way people come together to create, play, and connect. Across the globe, millions of creators build immersive, interactive experiences on our platform every day. As part of our Workplace Operations team, you will shape the day-to-day experience of our employees, partners, and visitors, creating a safe, vibrant, and welcoming physical environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;7&quot;&gt;As an&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;7&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;6&quot;&gt;Administrative and Badging Specialist&lt;/strong&gt;, you are the front-line ambassador for Roblox’s physical campus. You will blend front-desk operations, visitor hospitality, and enterprise access control to deliver a seamless experience for anyone walking through our doors.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;9&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;9&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;You will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;10&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;10,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;10,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Deliver Exceptional Front-Desk Support:&lt;/strong&gt; Serve as the primary point of contact for employees, visitors, contractors, and vendors while managing front-desk reception, phone inquiries, and room bookings.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;10,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;10,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Manage Enterprise Access Control:&lt;/strong&gt; Administer employee, contractor, and visitor badging procedures, verifying IDs and ensuring full compliance with Roblox security protocols.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;10,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;10,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Operate Workplace Tools:&lt;/strong&gt; Leverage systems such as &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;10,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;50&quot;&gt;Envoy&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;10,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;57&quot;&gt;G Suite&lt;/strong&gt;, and &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;10,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;70&quot;&gt;Genetec&lt;/strong&gt; to process check-ins, maintain badge inventory, and resolve access permissions promptly.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;10,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;10,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Streamline Onboarding &amp;amp; Offboarding:&lt;/strong&gt; Coordinate physical security access requests for incoming hires and departing team members, supporting regular audits and compliance reporting.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;10,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;10,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Elevate Workplace Operations:&lt;/strong&gt; Support special events, maintain confidentiality, and ensure a highly organized, professional environment across our spaces.&lt;/p&gt;
