&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;13,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;13,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;High Detail Orientation:&lt;/strong&gt; Ability to multitask, handle confidential information discreetly, and maintain accurate access records in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/p&gt;
