&lt;li&gt;Lead the development and implementation of global compensation programs, particularly bi-annual compensation review cycles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with cross functional teams in identifying processes, programs or capabilities that could benefit from automation, process enhancements or re-engineering to optimize performance and future growth opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement compensation systems to support cyclical compensation cycles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create materials to communicate strategic priorities and findings to senior management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and refine Excel models to conduct analysis related to compensation programs. Ability to see beyond the numbers and help inform, influence, support, and execute our business decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain reports, dashboards, and metrics and monitor the integrity and validity of the data reported&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Streamline compensation processes through operational and system enhancements via Workday, Zendesk, Jira and other internal systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
