&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;6+ years of experience in the technology industry, compensation, consulting, finance or a similarly applicable field&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A minimum of 5 years of progressive human resources and compensation experience with increasing levels of responsibility in identifying, consulting, designing, recommending, and implementing efficient, innovative business solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Proficiency in Google Sheets or Excel, including experience building analyses and automated models&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;K&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;nowledge of industry trends and developments in compensation&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Exceptional quantitative, analytical, and problem-solving skills&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Strong project management, organizational and communication skills&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
