&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Every day, tens of millions of people come to Roblox to explore, create, play, learn, and connect with friends in 3D immersive digital experiences– all created by our global community of developers and creators.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Roblox, we’re building the tools and platform that empower our community to bring any experience that they can imagine to life. Our vision is to reimagine the way people come together, from anywhere in the world, and on any device.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We’re on a mission to connect a billion people with optimism and civility, and looking for amazing talent to help us get there.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;A career at Roblox means you’ll be working to shape the future of human interaction, solving unique technical challenges at scale, and helping to create safer, more civil shared experiences for everyone.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Content Designer&lt;/strong&gt;, you’ll be a key member of the Accounts design team, playing a critical role in building the systems that keep Roblox safe, civil, and inclusive for a global community. You’ll focus on creating platform-level designs that make all accounts on Roblox accessible, authentic, and protected.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Roblox’s mission is to connect a billion people with optimism and civility. The Safety organization is at the heart of that mission, working to ensure everyone has seamless and secure access to accounts tied to their identity. We also work on building a world-class account access and management system, ensuring safe and fun family experiences, supporting compliance with global regulations, and providing a healthy, inclusive environment for users of all ages.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll collaborate closely with cross-functional teams across product, design, engineering, and research, shaping the platform&#39;s approach to trust and safety through thoughtful design. This is an opportunity to work at the systems level—defining how safety and account are embedded across Roblox and designing reusable frameworks that power our vision of civil immersive online communities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and deliver UX content strategy and execution for key Accounts surfaces and flows, including identity, account access and recovery, and family experiences, from early exploration through launch&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop a deep understanding of user needs, behaviors, and motivations, including young users, teens, adults, parents, and creators, to inform content design decisions across safety and account experiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define the content strategy and roadmap for Accounts, identifying where content can improve safety, trust, and account outcomes and driving that work forward&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead collaboration with product managers, designers, researchers, engineers, and policy partners to ensure experiences are valuable, understandable, and easy to use&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply UX writing and content strategy to high-stakes moments, balancing legal and regulatory requirements with clarity and usability across player, parent, and creator experiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and maintain content guidelines, patterns, and frameworks for safety and account experiences that support consistency in voice and tone, partnering with the Foundation Design Systems team to make them reusable&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate and document content decisions clearly, using empathy, logic, research insights, and data to inform recommendations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advocate for high-quality content design and influence product direction across Accounts, mentoring peers and partners on content best practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape team processes and ways of working, helping define how content design operates across groups&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and implement AI solutions to improve content quality and scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree or equivalent experience in Content Design, UX Writing, Communications, Human-Computer Interaction, or a related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive experience (5+ years) in content design, with a strong portfolio demonstrating expertise in designing for trust and safety, identity, accounts, or other high-stakes consumer experiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong systems thinking and a track record of designing scalable content patterns and frameworks for comprehensive, connected user experiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of user-centered design principles, information architecture, and content strategy for complex workflows such as identity verification, authentication, and account recovery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of collaborating with and influencing cross-functional partners, including product managers, designers, researchers, engineers, and policy teams, and shifting product decisions through content&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong drive to deeply understand product goals from both a business and user perspective, fostering a culture of learning and iteration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and presentation skills, with the ability to articulate content design concepts and rationale clearly and persuasively&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborative mindset with the ability to work effectively across teams and influence design direction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong interest in online safety, the gaming industry, and user-generated content platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keen interest in user experience trends, privacy, and emerging technologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A self-motivated approach to continuously expand design skills and explore new tools and techniques, including a proven ability to incorporate AI into your workflow&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;For roles that are based at our headquarters in San Mateo, CA: The starting base pay for this position is as shown below. The actual base pay is dependent upon a variety of job-related factors such as professional background, training, work experience, location, business needs and market demand. Therefore, in some circumstances, the actual salary could fall outside of this expected range. This pay range is subject to change and may be modified in the future. All full-time employees are also eligible for equity compensation and for benefits as described on &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.roblox.com/total-rewards&quot;&gt;this page&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Annual Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$193,240&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$230,150 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Roles that are based in an office are onsite Tuesday, Wednesday, and Thursday, with optional presence on Monday and Friday (unless otherwise noted).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Roblox provides equal employment opportunities to all employees and applicants for employment and prohibits discrimination and harassment of any type without regard to race, color, religion, age, sex, national origin, disability status, genetics, protected veteran status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state or local laws. Roblox also provides reasonable accommodations to candidates with qualifying disabilities or religious beliefs during the recruiting process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For US based roles only, please note the Company may not be able to employ candidates for this role who have United States work authorization related to certain U.S. visa categories, or support future H-1B sponsorship at this time.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Every day, tens of millions of people come to Roblox to explore, create, play, learn, and connect with friends in 3D immersive digital experiences– all created by our global community of developers and creators.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Roblox, we’re building the tools and platform that empower our community to bring any experience that they can imagine to life. Our vision is to reimagine the way people come together, from anywhere in the world, and on any device.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We’re on a mission to connect a billion people with optimism and civility, and looking for amazing talent to help us get there.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;A career at Roblox means you’ll be working to shape the future of human interaction, solving unique technical challenges at scale, and helping to create safer, more civil shared experiences for everyone.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;The Trust &amp;amp; Safety Operations team safeguards Roblox’s community and creators. Within this organization, our IP and Legal Compliance Operations teams are dedicated to protecting Intellectual Property, ensuring strict regulatory compliance, and facilitating a safe, fair environment for rights holders, developers, and users. We scale Operations and elevate our users’ experience through a multi‑year vision, rigorous execution, and data‑driven decision making.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be reporting to the Manager Data Operations and act as the data SME for both IP and Compliance Operations, working closely with other domain-specific data analysts on the team. This position is critical to understanding, optimizing, and reporting on the operational performance of our Intellectual Property enforcement and our Legal Compliance workflows.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the analysis and reporting for both &lt;strong&gt;I&lt;/strong&gt;ntellectual Property Operations and broader Legal Compliance Workflows. Deliver recurring KPI packs for senior leadership across Safety, Legal, and Developer Relations partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities through trend and cohort analysis; build business cases and lead cross‑functional initiatives from concept to impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Data Science, IP Product, Policy, and Operations teams to define and maintain metric definitions, KPI hierarchies, and analytical guardrails that drive operational excellence in both IP protection and compliance obligations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, build, and maintain advanced operational reports and dashboards, delivering critical insights on IP enforcement and overall compliance health to senior-level management and cross-functional stakeholders across Operations, Legal, Product, and Engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Select and apply the most appropriate analytical methods to assess both IP operations and Legal Compliance programs, extract relevant data, and derive actionable insights to ensure we meet all of Roblox&#39;s legal and regulatory obligations efficiently and accurately.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor industry trends in digital rights management, regulatory compliance frameworks, and analytical best practices; incorporate them into our operational data strategies and tooling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years of experience in a professional setting, with demonstrated experience in quantitative analysis and complex program management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Domain Knowledge: Good understanding of intellectual property operations (like copyrights, trademarks, and Digital Rights Management) and legal compliance processes (such as regulatory response SLAs, privacy operations, or law enforcement guidelines) in the tech industry—either through hands-on experience or by working closely on cross-functional projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical Proficiency: Advanced proficiency in SQL, including complex queries, common table expressions, and window functions; working knowledge of Git and Python and/or R is highly desirable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cross-Functional Leadership: Proven ability to work effectively with cross-functional teams (specifically Legal, Product, Engineering, and frontline IP/Compliance Operations) to drive strategic initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Problem Solving: Strong analytical skills with a track record of using data to inform decision-making, optimize complex workflows, and solve operational bottlenecks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Business Acumen: Deep understanding of business operations and the ability to align data strategies with strict legal, regulatory, and IP business objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise in consulting with stakeholders and managing complex projects from inception to completion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong multitasking and time management skills to balance the distinct needs of IP operations and Compliance operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum of a Bachelor’s degree in a technical field / analytical discipline (preferred: Computer Science, Data Analytics, Information Systems, Statistics, Mathematics, Business Analytics or equivalent), with a strong preference for an MBA or MS or equivalent experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Roles that are based in an office are onsite Tuesday, Wednesday, and Thursday, with optional presence on Monday and Friday (unless otherwise noted).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Roblox provides equal employment opportunities to all employees and applicants for employment and prohibits discrimination and harassment of any type without regard to race, color, religion, age, sex, national origin, disability status, genetics, protected veteran status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state or local laws. Roblox also provides reasonable accommodations to candidates with qualifying disabilities or religious beliefs during the recruiting process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For US based roles only, please note the Company may not be able to employ candidates for this role who have United States work authorization related to certain U.S. visa categories, or support future H-1B sponsorship at this time.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Every day, tens of millions of people come to Roblox to explore, create, play, learn, and connect with friends in 3D immersive digital experiences– all created by our global community of developers and creators.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Roblox, we’re building the tools and platform that empower our community to bring any experience that they can imagine to life. Our vision is to reimagine the way people come together, from anywhere in the world, and on any device.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We’re on a mission to connect a billion people with optimism and civility, and looking for amazing talent to help us get there.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;A career at Roblox means you’ll be working to shape the future of human interaction, solving unique technical challenges at scale, and helping to create safer, more civil shared experiences for everyone.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Data Center Engineer, you&#39;ll help us scale our Edge Data Centers and hardware infrastructure at a time of incredible growth for our business. At Roblox, you&#39;ll have boundless opportunities to shape the future of the Imagination Platform™ and demonstrate your passion for delivering thoughtful solutions in front of a global audience. If you know what it takes to build and operate hardware infrastructure that can sustain millions of concurrent players year-round and you take play as seriously as we do, you&#39;ll fit right into our highly experienced and ever-expanding engineering team. You will report to the Technical Lead, Edge Data Center Engineer.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and maintain the Edge Data Center and hardware infrastructure to meet the large scale and real-time requirements of our Imagination Platform™ to ensure our community has an awesome experience anywhere in the world. This includes all aspects of the server, network infrastructure, power, and environmental life cycles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own efforts to track and mitigate systemic issues preventing hosts from returning to service.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and solve critical problems and prevent them from re-occurring via root cause analysis and giving recommendations to improve automation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate with peers to establish and uphold best practices related to breakfix, install, decom and all other aspects of datacenter operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create, influence, and improve the development platform, infrastructure, standards (Runbooks, SOPs, MOPs), and methods to ensure the goal of scalability and high availability can be achieved.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage partnerships across teams to automate maintenance actions which do not require physical intervention.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Encourage an environment of continuous improvement and learning among engineering staff.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist in coordinating vendors and ensuring quality of outsourced projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in the on-call rotation for our critical infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Travel: Domestic and international travel will be required 25-50% of the time to support the physical deployment and scaling of our core/edge data center infrastructure at both domestic and global locations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At minimum 4+ years of experience working in large-scale Data Center Infrastructure environments, including experience with remote edge deployments and coordinating with &quot;smart hands&quot; or third-party contractors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive experience installing, monitoring, and maintaining server and network equipment. This includes brand new server and network provisioning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In-depth knowledge of data center environments, servers, and network equipment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience executing on multiple tasks simultaneously.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have installed various equipment that commonly resides in the data center environment and are able to lift 75 pounds occasionally.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Someone who is ready for action, willing to travel and get on-site to build our Domestic and global edge data centers. You wield a wealth of server and network hardware troubleshooting knowledge to support Roblox’s systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excited about getting in front of complex problems, and can effectively organize your work to overcome emergent high-impact issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Someone who enjoys building processes and procedures for the day to execute our workload and for developing new capabilities as a team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Someone who asks the right questions to solve issues within your expertise and you use data to test your theories. You are able to formulate and identify problems, generate and evaluate a variety of solutions (some of which are novel), and implement the best one(s).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Someone who is committed to demonstrating professionalism in all interactions with partners both inside and outside Roblox to ensure continued success in cross-functional initiatives. You are able to foster trust and uphold the reputation of the team and company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;For roles that are based at our headquarters in San Mateo, CA: The starting base pay for this position is as shown below. The actual base pay is dependent upon a variety of job-related factors such as professional background, training, work experience, location, business needs and market demand. Therefore, in some circumstances, the actual salary could fall outside of this expected range. This pay range is subject to change and may be modified in the future. All full-time employees are also eligible for equity compensation and for benefits as described on &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.roblox.com/total-rewards&quot;&gt;this page&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Annual Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$162,950&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$195,900 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Roles that are based in an office are onsite Tuesday, Wednesday, and Thursday, with optional presence on Monday and Friday (unless otherwise noted).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Roblox provides equal employment opportunities to all employees and applicants for employment and prohibits discrimination and harassment of any type without regard to race, color, religion, age, sex, national origin, disability status, genetics, protected veteran status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state or local laws. Roblox also provides reasonable accommodations to candidates with qualifying disabilities or religious beliefs during the recruiting process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For US based roles only, please note the Company may not be able to employ candidates for this role who have United States work authorization related to certain U.S. visa categories, or support future H-1B sponsorship at this time.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Every day, tens of millions of people come to Roblox to explore, create, play, learn, and connect with friends in 3D immersive digital experiences– all created by our global community of developers and creators.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Roblox, we’re building the tools and platform that empower our community to bring any experience that they can imagine to life. Our vision is to reimagine the way people come together, from anywhere in the world, and on any device.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We’re on a mission to connect a billion people with optimism and civility, and looking for amazing talent to help us get there.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;A career at Roblox means you’ll be working to shape the future of human interaction, solving unique technical challenges at scale, and helping to create safer, more civil shared experiences for everyone.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHY DATA SCIENCE &amp;amp; ANALYTICS?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Data Science &amp;amp; Analytics organization&#39;s mission is to increase our speed, frequency and acumen of making decisions at scale by instilling a data-influenced approach to building products. We cover a wide area of the data spectrum including analytical data engineering, product analytics, experimentation, causal inference, statistical modeling and machine learning. Aligned and partnering with product groups, we use this vast tool belt to discover new opportunities and unmet use cases, influence and shape the product roadmap and prioritization, build data products and measure the impact on our community of players and developers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHY Consumer Apps?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Roblox is used by tens of millions of people every day across a wide range of devices, including mobile, desktop, console, TV, and VR. The Consumer Apps team owns the app foundation that makes Roblox feel fast, fluid, and reliable for players and is dedicated to delivering superior performance, reliability, and user experience across all platforms Roblox supports. This team ensures a seamless and engaging user interface that facilitates intuitive interactions while enabling efficient, high-quality experiences across devices. Innovation is at the core of our work, as we continuously enhance features and integrate cutting-edge technologies to solve complex problems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Data Scientist on the team, you will help accelerate Roblox’s growth by shaping how we launch and optimize Roblox across the diverse device ecosystems where people connect, play, and co-experience. You will partner with Mobile, Desktop, Console, and emerging-platform teams to identify opportunities and develop platform-specific strategies that make Roblox feel best-in-class on every device. You will use data to guide investments across platform expansion, platform-specific product experiences, and ecosystem partnerships. You will develop measurement and experimentation frameworks to understand both the direct and broader ecosystem impact of these investments, helping teams identify growth opportunities, make informed tradeoffs, and continuously improve the Roblox experience while expanding universal access.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify high-potential platform levers and apply causal methods to understand their impact on user behavior, engagement, monetization, and other topline outcomes, translating these insights into platform-specific strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop deep expertise in the unique dynamics of each platform — including how the product is experienced, how user cohorts differ, and what drives their behavior — and proactively bring this perspective to broader research and cross-functional decision-making to identify opportunities and explain differences in product and business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build visibility into platform-level business performance and establish growth targets informed by internal data, market research, and competitive insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and analyze experiments to evaluate product launches, inform iteration, and drive rigorous, data-informed product decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advance how we measure product impact by developing innovative measurement and causal inference approaches where traditional A/B testing is not feasible, expanding the range of platform investments we can evaluate with rigor and confidence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Elevate data and experimentation rigor across the broader team by building scalable frameworks and practices around experiment design, success metrics, launch criteria, and launch readiness — helping teams launch confidently and consistently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build scalable monitoring and diagnostic capabilities that enable teams to quickly identify trends, investigate changes, and understand root causes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner across Data Science, Product, and Engineering — including Growth, Discovery, Social, and other product areas — to connect insights across surfaces, understand how platform and product changes affect the broader ecosystem, and translate complex data into actionable recommendations that shape strategy and drive impactful platform improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An advanced degree in Statistics, Applied Mathematics, Physics, Engineering, Computer Science, Economics, or a related quantitative field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of industry experience in Data Science or a related quantitative discipline, preferably working on consumer-facing products or applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical and technical skills, with proficiency in Python or R, SQL, and large-scale data processing and workflow tools such as Spark and Airflow.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep expertise in statistical analysis, causal inference, experimentation, and measurement methodologies, with a track record of applying these techniques to shape product strategy and drive business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to independently lead ambiguous, high-impact problem spaces, applying first-principles thinking to develop novel frameworks, approaches, and solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to influence across Product, Engineering, Design, Data Science, and leadership, shaping strategy, prioritizing investments, and driving alignment across organizational boundaries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional communication and storytelling skills, with the ability to distill complex, high-dimensional problems into clear insights and actionable recommendations for both technical and executive audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;For roles that are based at our headquarters in San Mateo, CA: The starting base pay for this position is as shown below. The actual base pay is dependent upon a variety of job-related factors such as professional background, training, work experience, location, business needs and market demand. Therefore, in some circumstances, the actual salary could fall outside of this expected range. This pay range is subject to change and may be modified in the future. All full-time employees are also eligible for equity compensation and for benefits as described on &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.roblox.com/total-rewards&quot;&gt;this page&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Annual Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$263,670&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$322,820 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Roles that are based in an office are onsite Tuesday, Wednesday, and Thursday, with optional presence on Monday and Friday (unless otherwise noted).&lt;/p&gt;
