&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vendor &amp;amp; Cross-Functional Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with hardware vendors and internal infrastructure teams to investigate component- and system-level failures across hardware, drivers, firmware, and kernel layers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
