&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive the design, deployment, and operations of Roblox&#39;s large-scale data center network, including the networking for GPU clusters that support training and inference workloads.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, qualify, and validate new technologies and hardware for scalable solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate data center builds and projects with multiple teams, including weekly cross-team calls.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with Network Reliability Systems, Data Center Ops, Capacity Planning, Supply Chain, and Compute/ML teams to address network challenges early.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to automation and telemetry that improve efficiency, reliability, and visibility.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in on-call rotation to support the global network infrastructure 24x7.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years of expertise designing and deploying large-scale data center fabrics (CLOS).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with GPU clusters or AI/ML networking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency deploying and managing 400G and 800G hardware.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Skilled in configuring and troubleshooting large-scale BGP deployments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of network protocols (TCP/IP, UDP, DHCP, DNS), with hands-on experience in IPv4 and IPv6.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Preferred: QoS, IS-IS, MPLS, RSVP-TE, DWDM, commercial NAT, open-source hardware and software.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;For roles that are based at our data center in &lt;strong&gt;Ashburn, VA&lt;/strong&gt;: The starting base pay for this position is as shown below. The actual base pay is dependent upon a variety of job-related factors such as professional background, training, work experience, location, business needs and market demand. Therefore, in some circumstances, the actual salary could fall outside of this expected range. This pay range is subject to change and may be modified in the future.&amp;nbsp; All full-time employees are also eligible for equity compensation and for benefits as described on &lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.roblox.com/total-rewards&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;this page&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Annual Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$218,970&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$265,730 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Roles that are based in an office are onsite Tuesday, Wednesday, and Thursday, with optional presence on Monday and Friday (unless otherwise noted).&lt;/p&gt;
