&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Every day, tens of millions of people come to Roblox to explore, create, play, learn, and connect with friends in 3D immersive digital experiences– all created by our global community of developers and creators.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Roblox, we’re building the tools and platform that empower our community to bring any experience that they can imagine to life. Our vision is to reimagine the way people come together, from anywhere in the world, and on any device.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We’re on a mission to connect a billion people with optimism and civility, and looking for amazing talent to help us get there.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;A career at Roblox means you’ll be working to shape the future of human interaction, solving unique technical challenges at scale, and helping to create safer, more civil shared experiences for everyone.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;We’re hiring a&lt;strong&gt; Senior&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;People Business Partner&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;to be the senior people strategist for User. You&#39;ll sit on the group leadership team as a trusted advisor to the group&#39;s senior engineering leader and their staff. You&#39;ll own the multi-year people strategy that lets User ship an ambitious roadmap while growing the leaders and builders who deliver it. You&#39;ll partner with a People Business Associate who supports frontline managers, so your time goes to org design, leadership bench, and group health, not straightforward manager and employee questions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;User is the group that builds what most people think of as “Roblox”. The app they open on their phone, console, or desktop, the friends they find and keep, the ways they chat and share moments, and the communities and first party live events they experience. It&#39;s a large, engineering-heavy group of engineering, product, design, and data science teams working across the &lt;strong&gt;Social (Communication, Community, Connection, Sharing), Consumer Apps, and Live&lt;/strong&gt; teams. The work is highly interdependent, what one team ships usually depends on several other teams and functions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll join the People Business Partner team in People &amp;amp; Systems and report to the Senior Director, People Business Partner Lead.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;You will&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Co-create User&#39;s multi-year people strategy&lt;/strong&gt; - Work with group leadership to turn product strategy into an annual people plan and a multi-year talent roadmap covering capability gaps, succession, future skills, and where to invest&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diagnose and improve the system, not treat the symptom&lt;/strong&gt; - Analyze User&#39;s operating model, org design, spans and layers, and talent systems to find friction and misalignment with the business strategy. Then build the case for structural change and see it through&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Orchestrate change across teams&lt;/strong&gt; - Lead large, multi-team changes, including reorgs, team integrations, and new operating rhythms, so leaders can keep shipping while the org evolves&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build the leadership bench&lt;/strong&gt; - Partner with senior leaders on a long-term plan for leadership capability and succession across the group. Make sure development plans are real and in use, and treat RoGRO as one input, not the endpoint&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bring data to the leadership table&lt;/strong&gt; - Combine internal people data (engagement, attrition, performance, progression) with external research to produce forward-looking insights that change decisions. Help leaders read the signal, not just the dashboard or report&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Use AI to work differently&lt;/strong&gt; - Use AI tools to speed up analysis, synthesis, and program design. Help User&#39;s leaders think through how AI changes team design, skills, and the work of managers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shape culture with leaders&lt;/strong&gt; - Use people data to find systemic barriers to engagement and inclusion, and design interventions that reflect Roblox&#39;s values. Hold senior leaders to their people commitments, courageously and constructively&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Make User a place great builders choose&lt;/strong&gt; - Shape hiring programs, capacity planning, and employer brand for the group so User attracts and keeps the talent it needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;You have&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years in HR, people strategy, or organizational effectiveness, including significant time as a senior PBP/HRBP partnering with VP-level leaders in engineering-centric, product-driven technology organizations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of org design and change at scale: reorgs, operating model shifts, or integrations affecting hundreds of people, with outcomes you can measure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Built and owned multi-year talent strategies: succession and bench planning, workforce planning (build / buy / borrow), and leadership development that moved readiness metrics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical judgment. You&#39;re comfortable working directly with people data, partnering with People Analytics, and turning complex findings into a clear narrative for senior leaders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on use of AI tools in your own work, and curiosity about how AI is changing team design and the role of managers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Executive presence and courage: you influence senior technical leaders through credibility and evidence, and you&#39;ll tell them what they need to hear&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Discretion with highly confidential information, and comfort operating in ambiguity at the pace of a founder-led company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Nice to have&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting consumer, social, or communications products at scale, or mobile and cross-platform app organizations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in I-O psychology, organization development, or an equivalent evidence-based approaches to how people work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in a PBP/associate (or HRBP/HR generalist) partnership model where you have mentored and partnered closely with partner functions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;For roles that are based at our headquarters in San Mateo, CA: The starting base pay for this position is as shown below. The actual base pay is dependent upon a variety of job-related factors such as professional background, training, work experience, location, business needs and market demand. Therefore, in some circumstances, the actual salary could fall outside of this expected range. This pay range is subject to change and may be modified in the future. All full-time employees are also eligible for equity compensation and for benefits as described on &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.roblox.com/total-rewards&quot;&gt;this page&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Annual Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$270,630&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$304,420 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Roles that are based in an office are onsite Tuesday, Wednesday, and Thursday, with optional presence on Monday and Friday (unless otherwise noted).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Roblox provides equal employment opportunities to all employees and applicants for employment and prohibits discrimination and harassment of any type without regard to race, color, religion, age, sex, national origin, disability status, genetics, protected veteran status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state or local laws. Roblox also provides reasonable accommodations to candidates with qualifying disabilities or religious beliefs during the recruiting process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For US based roles only, please note the Company may not be able to employ candidates for this role who have United States work authorization related to certain U.S. visa categories, or support future H-1B sponsorship at this time.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Every day, tens of millions of people come to Roblox to explore, create, play, learn, and connect with friends in 3D immersive digital experiences– all created by our global community of developers and creators.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Roblox, we’re building the tools and platform that empower our community to bring any experience that they can imagine to life. Our vision is to reimagine the way people come together, from anywhere in the world, and on any device.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We’re on a mission to connect a billion people with optimism and civility, and looking for amazing talent to help us get there.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;A career at Roblox means you’ll be working to shape the future of human interaction, solving unique technical challenges at scale, and helping to create safer, more civil shared experiences for everyone.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;As the Senior/Principal Product Manager for Engine Networking, you will drive the vision and strategy for the game engine networking stack/server aspect of our client-server architecture and be hands-on with the execution and delivery of products that impact over 130 million players every day.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This team is responsible for the fundamental competitive game networking stack, from replication and streaming to asset delivery and caching, and our cloud game servers.&amp;nbsp; This includes close partnerships with our broader Infrastructure and Matchmaking teams to ensure our systems are getting the most out of our infrastructure and our players the best experience possible.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you are a visionary product leader who thrives on deeply technical challenges and loves networks, you’ll be a great fit!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The role is based in San Mateo, CA (hybrid with Tues-Thurs onsite).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define the long-term vision and strategy for Engine Networking, ensuring we have plans in place to continually invest in the core pieces of a high-performance, realtime connected game engine.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive execution of new architectural systems, such as our upcoming offline play feature.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with the Infrastructure organization to optimize the technical KPIs around networked gameplay, such as latency, from participating in matchmaking experiments to helping with future data center buildout work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion data rigor, working with Data Science to identify opportunities and measure the efficacy of our work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Think outside the box, working closely with engineering, to consider how the latest advances in AI, architecture, and more combine to deliver step-function improvements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Go hands-on to bring the roadmap to life partnering with engineering leadership to ensure all features are built and deployed successfully.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor and elevate the product culture within the team, fostering an environment of rigorous thinking, experimentation, and relentless customer empathy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You have:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years of product management experience, with a significant portion spent in technically deep products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical Fluency: A strong technical background (CS degree or equivalent experience) with the ability to discuss networking stacks and similar with engineering partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategic Leadership: Proven ability to define a multi-year product vision and rally large, cross-functional teams (Engineering, Data Science) behind it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Entrepreneurial drive: You have a &quot;Founder&quot; mindset. You are comfortable operating in ambiguity, making high-stakes decisions with limited information, and driving projects from vague concepts to global launch.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly Analytical: Proficiency in defining and tracking complex metrics. You use data to find the &quot;signal in the noise.”&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Executive Communication: Exceptional written and verbal communication skills. You can explain complex technical topics to non-technical executives and define detailed technical specs for engineers with equal fluency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with competitive game engines/low-latency networking systems and/or UGC platforms is a strong plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;For roles that are based at our headquarters in San Mateo, CA: The starting base pay for this position is as shown below. The actual base pay is dependent upon a variety of job-related factors such as professional background, training, work experience, location, business needs and market demand. Therefore, in some circumstances, the actual salary could fall outside of this expected range. This pay range is subject to change and may be modified in the future. All full-time employees are also eligible for equity compensation and for benefits as described on &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.roblox.com/total-rewards&quot;&gt;this page&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Annual Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$280,540&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$330,950 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Roles that are based in an office are onsite Tuesday, Wednesday, and Thursday, with optional presence on Monday and Friday (unless otherwise noted).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Roblox provides equal employment opportunities to all employees and applicants for employment and prohibits discrimination and harassment of any type without regard to race, color, religion, age, sex, national origin, disability status, genetics, protected veteran status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state or local laws. Roblox also provides reasonable accommodations to candidates with qualifying disabilities or religious beliefs during the recruiting process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For US based roles only, please note the Company may not be able to employ candidates for this role who have United States work authorization related to certain U.S. visa categories, or support future H-1B sponsorship at this time.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Every day, tens of millions of people come to Roblox to explore, create, play, learn, and connect with friends in 3D immersive digital experiences– all created by our global community of developers and creators.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Roblox, we’re building the tools and platform that empower our community to bring any experience that they can imagine to life. Our vision is to reimagine the way people come together, from anywhere in the world, and on any device.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We’re on a mission to connect a billion people with optimism and civility, and looking for amazing talent to help us get there.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;A career at Roblox means you’ll be working to shape the future of human interaction, solving unique technical challenges at scale, and helping to create safer, more civil shared experiences for everyone.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;The mission of the Foundation AI group is to enable Roblox Creators to accelerate their workflows and to put GenAI in the hands of millions of users. We envision a future in which experiences on Roblox leverage generative text and speech capabilities to enable new forms of interaction, generative 3D and 4D capabilities to enable new ways to create, and generative video to give creators a level of visual fidelity and motion that has never been available at this scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We shipped our 3D foundation model, which takes text prompts as input and generates production ready 3D objects and worlds. We are now building the Roblox Video Model; the Super Upsampler at the heart of Roblox Reality, our hybrid architecture that pairs the structured simulation of the Roblox Game Engine and Roblox Cloud with the photorealism of Video World Models. The engine stays the source of truth for the data model: state, physics, collision, logic, and multiplayer consistency. The video model generates the pixels: higher fidelity textures, realistic lighting, secondary motion, fluid dynamics, and the unscripted detail of a real world. A world model paired with our engine, enables persistent, multiplayer, photorealistic worlds that any creator can build and any player can join.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the Senior/Principal Product Manager for Video Generation, your job is to put that in the hands of our community. You will take the Roblox Video Model out of the lab and into creator early access, then to a platform capability available to everyone, running on cloud edge GPU infrastructure, scaling toward tens of millions of concurrents, and keeping agency firmly with the creator. You will own the strategy and vision, define how creators direct and control the model.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build a vision and strategy for real-time video generation that delights creators and players and leads to industry-defining innovation in world models.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the launch to our community — from lab demo, to creator early access, to scaled platform capability — and earn the trust of a community with real concerns about AI in creation by shipping in the open and proving the model serves them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define the creator control surface: how creators condition, direct, and constrain the model so their game rules, art direction, and systems are never overridden.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deeply understand the model capabilities our creators need — temporal coherence, multiplayer consistency, avatar fidelity, prompt and style adherence — and shape the research roadmap against them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop comprehensive evaluation for our models, combining automated metrics with creator and player feedback, and own the quality, latency, and cost curve with research and infrastructure so this scales affordably.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work across the company — with engine, rendering, creator, safety, and economy — to make generated pixels safe, age-appropriate, and a core part of gameplay.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage from vision through the product life cycle, prioritizing by working with creators and analyzing how our model is used, while providing insights to non-technical audiences and holding your own with world-class AI researchers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of solving hard problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience building, shipping, or supporting generative media products — video, image, or world models — or real-time rendering and graphics technology at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience productizing research: turning model capabilities into product and product signal back into research priorities, with fluency in the tradeoffs that define this space — quality, latency, inference cost, and compute.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A deep understanding of the product life cycle and a history of collaborating with engineering teams and other stakeholders to deliver complex technical products on time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience shipping to large consumer or creator communities, ideally in gaming, UGC platforms, or creative tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A Masters degree or equivalent experience in Computer Science, Computer Engineering, Computer Graphics, 3D Animation, or Games Production, or a similar technical field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for driving user-centric product decisions with an inclusive and strategic mindset, comfort in a fast-moving and ambiguous environment, and a high degree of independent drive.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;For roles that are based at our headquarters in San Mateo, CA: The starting base pay for this position is as shown below. The actual base pay is dependent upon a variety of job-related factors such as professional background, training, work experience, location, business needs and market demand. Therefore, in some circumstances, the actual salary could fall outside of this expected range. This pay range is subject to change and may be modified in the future. All full-time employees are also eligible for equity compensation and for benefits as described on &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.roblox.com/total-rewards&quot;&gt;this page&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Annual Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$330,950&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$383,120 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Roles that are based in an office are onsite Tuesday, Wednesday, and Thursday, with optional presence on Monday and Friday (unless otherwise noted).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Roblox provides equal employment opportunities to all employees and applicants for employment and prohibits discrimination and harassment of any type without regard to race, color, religion, age, sex, national origin, disability status, genetics, protected veteran status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state or local laws. Roblox also provides reasonable accommodations to candidates with qualifying disabilities or religious beliefs during the recruiting process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For US based roles only, please note the Company may not be able to employ candidates for this role who have United States work authorization related to certain U.S. visa categories, or support future H-1B sponsorship at this time.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Every day, tens of millions of people come to Roblox to explore, create, play, learn, and connect with friends in 3D immersive digital experiences– all created by our global community of developers and creators.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Roblox, we’re building the tools and platform that empower our community to bring any experience that they can imagine to life. Our vision is to reimagine the way people come together, from anywhere in the world, and on any device.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We’re on a mission to connect a billion people with optimism and civility, and looking for amazing talent to help us get there.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;A career at Roblox means you’ll be working to shape the future of human interaction, solving unique technical challenges at scale, and helping to create safer, more civil shared experiences for everyone.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;As a Principal Software Engineer on Creator Services Data, you’ll be leading the company’s efforts to build the next generation Data Storage systems to power the millions of experiences on the Roblox Platform.&amp;nbsp; We run the mission critical cloud services,&lt;a href=&quot;https://create.roblox.com/docs/cloud-services/data-stores&quot;&gt; Data Stores&lt;/a&gt;,&lt;a href=&quot;https://create.roblox.com/docs/cloud-services/memory-stores&quot;&gt; Memory Stores&lt;/a&gt;, and&lt;a href=&quot;https://create.roblox.com/docs/production/publishing/badges&quot;&gt; Badges&lt;/a&gt;, which are crucial for storing game state such as inventory and scores, implementing leaderboards, server lists, and trading, and tracking player progress and achievements.&amp;nbsp; Our team is also responsible for building dashboards to provide insights to Creators using cloud services including&lt;a href=&quot;https://create.roblox.com/docs/production/analytics/performance&quot;&gt; Client/Server Performance&lt;/a&gt;,&lt;a href=&quot;https://create.roblox.com/docs/cloud-services/data-stores/observability&quot;&gt; Data Stores&lt;/a&gt;, and&lt;a href=&quot;https://create.roblox.com/docs/cloud-services/memory-stores/observability&quot;&gt; Memory Stores&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp; Finally, our team owns the&lt;a href=&quot;https://devforum.roblox.com/t/announcing-roblox-extended-services/3621439&quot;&gt; Roblox Extended Services&lt;/a&gt; platform, which provides the capability for large experiences to purchase additional resources for existing services like Data Stores and new services built around compute and generative AI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At its core, this team is focused on solving complex back end distributed systems and storage problems at scale.&amp;nbsp; However, our scope extends to full stack projects spanning all the way from the infrastructure layer, through data storage and data pipelines, microservices, telemetry, game servers, web development, UI, and UX design.&amp;nbsp; This team collaborates on multiple cross-company efforts and our projects are of extremely high importance to Roblox.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the design and development of improvements to existing products and design new cloud services to support our Creator Community.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build state-of-the-art data storage systems including infrastructure, serving layers, clients, and web APIs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expand the internal and customer facing cloud service observability capabilities through metrics collection, data pipelines, intelligent analytics, data visualization, and dashboards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Increase the capabilities and onboard new customers to the Roblox Extended Services platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with our users (Creators) to identify product gaps and bugs and handle customer emergencies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide on-call support for our Data products including responding to production alerts and outages.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor junior engineers and provide technical and non-technical guidance through design and code reviews, joint projects, 1:1s, and peer feedback.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead collaborations on a cross-functional team including UX design, product management, project management, developer relations, documentation, customer support, and other engineering teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Become a recognized technical leader across the company and contribute to company-wide initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years background in software development building with public clouds (AWS, Azure, and GCP), microservices and distributed systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years experience &lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;building and maintaining&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; (not just using) data storage systems (relational databases, key/value stores, blob stores, etc)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years designing, implementing, testing, and deploying robust, scalable, and well documented production-grade code&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years programming in C# and/or C++ (ideally both)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years experience working on agile, fast-paced, high-impact software teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years leading junior engineers and new graduates on complex software engineering projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Desired (one or more of)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience building big data pipelines or batch processing systems (MapReduce, Hadoop, Flink, Spark, Flume)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience programming computer games, particularly in Lua/Luau&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior knowledge of data science, data analytics, machine learning, or AI&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience building graphical user interfaces, dashboards, or web application front ends&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Innovative: &lt;/strong&gt;We strive for novel solutions that bridge the technical needs of Roblox with the creative needs of our developer community. This typically involves tackling competing objectives and thinking creatively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Passionate: &lt;/strong&gt;We are looking for new team members who are passionate about data storage technology, computer games, and software development. We are excited about building new products that will redefine the future of human online interaction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Versatile:&lt;/strong&gt; The Data Pod is expanding its scope beyond providing low level storage solutions to building higher level services such as User Profiles and LiveOps Analytics. We are also working on projects such as Observability and Billing &amp;amp; Payments platforms. You need to be ready to learn new programming languages and tech stacks as we evolve.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsible:&lt;/strong&gt; Data Storage services cannot go down and cannot lose data. You are committed to join a team that strives for a 100% uptime and data durability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team Oriented: &lt;/strong&gt;You are ready to both guide and learn from others. You will set the standard on team collaboration and communication. You exemplify&lt;a href=&quot;https://corp.roblox.com/newsroom/2024/04/roblox-values-principles&quot;&gt; Roblox Values and Principles&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;For roles that are based at our headquarters in San Mateo, CA: The starting base pay for this position is as shown below. The actual base pay is dependent upon a variety of job-related factors such as professional background, training, work experience, location, business needs and market demand. Therefore, in some circumstances, the actual salary could fall outside of this expected range. This pay range is subject to change and may be modified in the future. All full-time employees are also eligible for equity compensation and for benefits as described on &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.roblox.com/total-rewards&quot;&gt;this page&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Annual Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$345,040&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$399,420 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Roles that are based in an office are onsite Tuesday, Wednesday, and Thursday, with optional presence on Monday and Friday (unless otherwise noted).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Roblox provides equal employment opportunities to all employees and applicants for employment and prohibits discrimination and harassment of any type without regard to race, color, religion, age, sex, national origin, disability status, genetics, protected veteran status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state or local laws. Roblox also provides reasonable accommodations to candidates with qualifying disabilities or religious beliefs during the recruiting process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For US based roles only, please note the Company may not be able to employ candidates for this role who have United States work authorization related to certain U.S. visa categories, or support future H-1B sponsorship at this time.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Every day, tens of millions of people come to Roblox to explore, create, play, learn, and connect with friends in 3D immersive digital experiences– all created by our global community of developers and creators.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Roblox, we’re building the tools and platform that empower our community to bring any experience that they can imagine to life. Our vision is to reimagine the way people come together, from anywhere in the world, and on any device.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We’re on a mission to connect a billion people with optimism and civility, and looking for amazing talent to help us get there.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;A career at Roblox means you’ll be working to shape the future of human interaction, solving unique technical challenges at scale, and helping to create safer, more civil shared experiences for everyone.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Product Designer for Consumer App, you will shape how users navigate and interact with the Roblox platform. This is a high-impact role requiring a blend of systematic thinking and meticulous craft. You will work across the foundations of our consumer app: its core architecture and navigation, its information architecture, the interaction models that make it feel native on every device, and the platform features used across the app.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will design the ecosystem of UI and controls across the Roblox app and within the games where our users spend the majority of their time. This requires solving complex problems, such as translating 2D interfaces into 3D environments, while ensuring flows remain adaptive across mobile, desktop, console, and XR. You’ll shape both the vision and the details, and help decide how the Roblox app should evolve as players and creators move across every surface.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;You will:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape the app’s structure. Contribute to the core architecture, navigation and information architecture that keep Roblox one product across mobile, desktop, console, TV and XR.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design for every input. Define interaction models where touch, mouse and keyboard, gamepad and headset are part of the design from the start, not ports at the end.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define the system UI. Set the UI architecture and interaction patterns for the app and in game, so users engage experience first class UX and teams have a clear model to follow when they add new features.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design core platform features. Design the shared capabilities players rely on everywhere in the app, built once so they work consistently on every surface.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive UX strategy. Frame the problem, set direction with PM, engineering, data science and research, and use A/B tests and research to decide what comes next.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Influence across teams. Bring partner teams along so their work fits the app instead of reinventing it, and present your reasoning to leadership with clarity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prototype in context. Use AI-assisted tools to test interactions on real devices and inputs, and help the team find faster ways to work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;You have:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years in product design, with shipped work on navigation, information architecture or interaction models at platform scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong craft across visual and interaction design, and fluency in Figma (auto layout, variables, components).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of UX strategy: framing ambiguous problems, setting direction, and getting it shipped with cross-functional partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cross-platform experience: Knowledge of designing for mobile, desktop, console, and XR environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced prototyping skills (Figma, Origami, ProtoPie or code), including hands-on use of AI tools to explore and prototype faster.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Influence without authority across several teams, and the judgment to say no with a better alternative.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional communication: The ability to tell a compelling story, move stakeholders to action, and document systems with precision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;For roles that are based at our headquarters in San Mateo, CA: The starting base pay for this position is as shown below. The actual base pay is dependent upon a variety of job-related factors such as professional background, training, work experience, location, business needs and market demand. Therefore, in some circumstances, the actual salary could fall outside of this expected range. This pay range is subject to change and may be modified in the future. All full-time employees are also eligible for equity compensation and for benefits as described on &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.roblox.com/total-rewards&quot;&gt;this page&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Annual Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$271,070&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$322,840 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Roles that are based in an office are onsite Tuesday, Wednesday, and Thursday, with optional presence on Monday and Friday (unless otherwise noted).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Roblox provides equal employment opportunities to all employees and applicants for employment and prohibits discrimination and harassment of any type without regard to race, color, religion, age, sex, national origin, disability status, genetics, protected veteran status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state or local laws. Roblox also provides reasonable accommodations to candidates with qualifying disabilities or religious beliefs during the recruiting process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For US based roles only, please note the Company may not be able to employ candidates for this role who have United States work authorization related to certain U.S. visa categories, or support future H-1B sponsorship at this time.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Every day, tens of millions of people come to Roblox to explore, create, play, learn, and connect with friends in 3D immersive digital experiences– all created by our global community of developers and creators.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Roblox, we’re building the tools and platform that empower our community to bring any experience that they can imagine to life. Our vision is to reimagine the way people come together, from anywhere in the world, and on any device.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We’re on a mission to connect a billion people with optimism and civility, and looking for amazing talent to help us get there.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;A career at Roblox means you’ll be working to shape the future of human interaction, solving unique technical challenges at scale, and helping to create safer, more civil shared experiences for everyone.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;AI models reshaping how our community creates, plays, and connects, all run on Compute Platform. As&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Product Manager, AI Compute Infrastructure&lt;/strong&gt;, you&#39;ll set the strategy and roadmap for Roblox&#39;s next-generation AI infrastructure: the rapidly growing fleet of GPUs and AI accelerators spanning Roblox core and edge data centers, and public cloud that decides how fast we can train, serve, and scale every model on the platform. You&#39;ll own the products that turn raw GPU hosts into reliable, production-ready AI compute - driver and firmware management, fleet-wide health and performance, and the abstractions product teams across Roblox build on.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive strategy and roadmap for Compute Platform spanning Managed Kubernetes (Roblox Kubernetes Service), Managed Compute Services and other critical distributed systems, and our fleet of GPU and CPU machines managed via unified Fleet APIs - all across on-prem and cloud.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive the evolution of our Compute infrastructure to support Roblox’s most critical workloads - from AI to Storage to Data Analytics and more -&amp;nbsp; each with their own distinct requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and scale our GPU infrastructure to support training and inference for frontier models, enabling innovation at scale while optimizing cost-to-serve.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay laser-focused on Compute Platform Reliability for AI and other Roblox workloads, lowering mean-time-to-detection and recovery from failures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with seven key platform teams to understand their use cases and empower them with Compute Platform primitives enabling them to build on top easily.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead cross-functionally, acting as the connective tissue between Compute Platform Users, Engineers, AI researchers, Product, Finance, and Roblox leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years of product management experience, focused on Compute infrastructure or distributed systems at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep practical understanding of Kubernetes internals and control plane components (API Server bottlenecks, Etcd scaling limitations, Kubelet behavior, etc) and experience productizing custom Kubernetes Operators, Controllers, and Custom Resource Definitions (CRDs) to extend platform capabilities beyond vanilla implementations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep familiarity with GPU/accelerator architecture and scheduling challenges, including topology-aware placement, preemption, hardware affinity constraints, and mechanisms to validate resource readiness before scheduling to avoid wasted compute cycles.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with cloud-native service networking including microservices, CNIs, and enterprise-grade service mesh architectures.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Built production-grade compute platforms where efficiency, reliability, and developer experience were designed-in from day one.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to balance the needs of multiple users and stakeholders and make optimal tradeoffs between utilization, latency, cost and time-to-ship while maintaining reliability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A builder mindset - you are passionate about prototyping, evolving products through rapid iteration, and leveraging AI for ideation and unlocking value for users.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building Compute infrastructure on AWS, Google Cloud Platform (GCP), Azure or other cloud providers. (preferred)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in AI model development, training, inference. (preferred)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Kernel-level experience or familiarity with custom kernel drivers. (preferred)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building agentic systems for Compute or infrastructure. (preferred)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;For roles that are based at our headquarters in San Mateo, CA: The starting base pay for this position is as shown below. The actual base pay is dependent upon a variety of job-related factors such as professional background, training, work experience, location, business needs and market demand. Therefore, in some circumstances, the actual salary could fall outside of this expected range. This pay range is subject to change and may be modified in the future. All full-time employees are also eligible for equity compensation and for benefits as described on &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.roblox.com/total-rewards&quot;&gt;this page&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Annual Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$280,540&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$330,950 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Roles that are based in an office are onsite Tuesday, Wednesday, and Thursday, with optional presence on Monday and Friday (unless otherwise noted).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Roblox provides equal employment opportunities to all employees and applicants for employment and prohibits discrimination and harassment of any type without regard to race, color, religion, age, sex, national origin, disability status, genetics, protected veteran status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state or local laws. Roblox also provides reasonable accommodations to candidates with qualifying disabilities or religious beliefs during the recruiting process.&lt;/p&gt;
