&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing metric or semantic platforms, data catalogs, lineage systems, or data governance capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience integrating metric definitions with multiple query or compute engines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contributions to open-source projects in the data infrastructure ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience operating data infrastructure at consumer-internet scale.&lt;/li&gt;
