&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, develop, use AI/LLMs, optimize, and debug video capture, encoding, playback, and rendering focused on the Android platform using NDK APIs like Vulkan and AMediaCodec.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Innovate, architect, and implement our vision for video in a 3D immersive environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have the opportunity to work across our platforms (desktop, mobile, and consoles).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have the opportunity to work on our backend microservices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with different teams all across Roblox to develop new uses of video.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be guided to create state of the art video tech for gaming industry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An experienced engineer with 8+ years of designing, developing, and debugging complex C++ applications running on Android.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An expert with the wide variety of Android devices from junk to gold.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient with using Vulkan or OpenGL on Android in a performance oriented environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledgeable within the video domain. You know the difference between AVC, HEVC, and AV1. You understand how video is compressed, delivered, and decoded. You don&#39;t have to look up the meaning of YUV or HLS. You love to pick up new technologies as the landscape evolves.&lt;/li&gt;
