&lt;p&gt;Role is based in our San Mateo, CA office 3 days a week (Tuesday-Thursday). No remote exceptions.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
