&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Senior Technical Artist to sit at the intersection of art, engineering, and future technologies - shaping next-generation Terrain tools, Character systems, and AI-powered pipelines. Your work will directly influence what Roblox users experience every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;You will:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with engineers to actively participate in the development of new GenAI-native production pipelines implemented in our Roblox Studio&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be a subject matter expert on tools and technology, bring industry best practices to the 3D Art team, and share Technical Art guidance and perspective with Engineering and Product&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prototype and test new improvements to general creation tools like terrain tooling and shader functionality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Test and compare multiple generative tools and workflows, document results, and recommend best practices to the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help develop and document new GenAI/traditional hybrid workflows, collaborating with production and technology teams to improve efficiency and creative output.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage with external creators to advise on best practices and surface opportunities to further improve workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;You have:&lt;/h3&gt;
