&lt;li&gt;A Bachelor’s degree or proven experience in a related CG field or computer science&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years experience in the game industry, worked on titles on multiple platforms (mobile a plus)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of real-time engines and DCC.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
