&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Every day, tens of millions of people come to Roblox to explore, create, play, learn, and connect with friends in 3D immersive digital experiences– all created by our global community of developers and creators.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Roblox, we’re building the tools and platform that empower our community to bring any experience that they can imagine to life. Our vision is to reimagine the way people come together, from anywhere in the world, and on any device.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We’re on a mission to connect a billion people with optimism and civility, and looking for amazing talent to help us get there.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;A career at Roblox means you’ll be working to shape the future of human interaction, solving unique technical challenges at scale, and helping to create safer, more civil shared experiences for everyone.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Threat Intelligence Analyst on the Safety Intelligence team, you&#39;ll proactively hunt for emerging threats to Roblox&#39;s community before they become incidents. You&#39;ll work across harm domains, following actors, networks, and tactics as they move between child endangerment, violent extremism, extortion, fraud, and other critical harms to surface connections that single-domain efforts can miss. You&#39;ll combine internal platform data, open-source and off-platform collection, and AI-assisted tooling to turn weak signals into finished intelligence that drives detection, enforcement, product changes, and partnerships. You&#39;ll report to the Manager, Safety Intelligence and Investigations and partner closely with Investigations, Moderation Operations, Policy, Product, Engineering, Data Science, and Law Enforcement Operations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Please note: This role requires reviewing graphic, controversial, and offensive content in accordance with Roblox&#39;s handling policies.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead proactive, hypothesis-driven threat hunts across harm domains, using internal data, open-source intelligence, and off-platform collection to find the unknown unknowns: new actors, tactics, and evasion techniques, before they scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify cross-domain connections by tracking actors, networks, and behaviors that span multiple harm types, and assess how co-occurring harms reinforce one another on and off the platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Produce clear, multi-sourced finished intelligence (threat assessments, trend analyses, and briefings) for audiences from analysts to senior leaders, with stated confidence levels and actionable recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Turn findings into action by partnering with Data Science, Engineering, and Moderation Operations to develop detection signals and behavioral indicators, and by handing off high-risk leads to Investigations and Law Enforcement Operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help define and maintain priority intelligence requirements and collection plans, and track how intelligence changes decisions so we can show its impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build repeatable hunting methods, including playbooks, queries, and AI-assisted workflows, and mentor other analysts in tradecraft, analytic standards, and writing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years of experience in threat intelligence, trust and safety investigations, cybersecurity, extremism or counter-terrorism analysis, or a related intelligence discipline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of proactively hunting threat actors, not only responding to reports: forming hypotheses, collecting across multiple sources, and validating findings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of more than one harm domain (for example child safety, violent extremism, fraud, extortion, or illicit goods) and the ability to see how they overlap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced proficiency with SQL, scripting (such as Python), and open-source intelligence methods to analyze large datasets, recognize behavioral patterns, and pivot between data sources.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills, with experience delivering finished intelligence to both technical and executive audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working across matrixed teams (such as Product, Engineering, Policy, Legal, and law enforcement) to turn analysis into action, and comfort operating in ambiguity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Bonus:&lt;/em&gt; experience on an online platform, social media, or gaming trust and safety or intelligence team; experience applying AI or LLM tools to investigative workflows; experience with industry or law enforcement information sharing; relevant foreign language skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;For roles that are based at our headquarters in San Mateo, CA: The starting base pay for this position is as shown below. The actual base pay is dependent upon a variety of job-related factors such as professional background, training, work experience, location, business needs and market demand. Therefore, in some circumstances, the actual salary could fall outside of this expected range. This pay range is subject to change and may be modified in the future. All full-time employees are also eligible for equity compensation and for benefits as described on &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.roblox.com/total-rewards&quot;&gt;this page&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Annual Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$154,970&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$184,570 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Roles that are based in an office are onsite Tuesday, Wednesday, and Thursday, with optional presence on Monday and Friday (unless otherwise noted).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Roblox provides equal employment opportunities to all employees and applicants for employment and prohibits discrimination and harassment of any type without regard to race, color, religion, age, sex, national origin, disability status, genetics, protected veteran status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state or local laws. Roblox also provides reasonable accommodations to candidates with qualifying disabilities or religious beliefs during the recruiting process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For US based roles only, please note the Company may not be able to employ candidates for this role who have United States work authorization related to certain U.S. visa categories, or support future H-1B sponsorship at this time.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Every day, tens of millions of people come to Roblox to explore, create, play, learn, and connect with friends in 3D immersive digital experiences– all created by our global community of developers and creators.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Roblox, we’re building the tools and platform that empower our community to bring any experience that they can imagine to life. Our vision is to reimagine the way people come together, from anywhere in the world, and on any device.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We’re on a mission to connect a billion people with optimism and civility, and looking for amazing talent to help us get there.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;A career at Roblox means you’ll be working to shape the future of human interaction, solving unique technical challenges at scale, and helping to create safer, more civil shared experiences for everyone.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;As a Software Engineer on Account Security, you will help protect Roblox users, creators, and the broader community from bad actors. We are an outcome oriented team that has the tremendous latitude to make changes across the Roblox technical stack to secure accounts. Past examples of work include work to model post-login suspicion, cryptographically bind user credentials to devices, malware detection, and work to detect and prevent asset laundering that typically is used to monetize ATOs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll join Roblox&#39;s Safety organization, whose mission is to become the leader in civil immersive online communities by detecting, removing, and preventing problematic accounts, content, and behavior, and by keeping accounts secure and free from compromise. The team draws on a broad tech spectrum, including machine learning, classifiers, experimentation, automation, and AI-powered filters, partnering with product teams to shape the roadmap, build safety products, and measure impact on our community of users and developers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the design, implementation and landing of features to prevent, detect and mitigate account takeovers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate cross-organizationally with partner teams in InfoSec, Economy, User, and the broader Roblox Safety org.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help define how goals get accomplished and have real influence over product direction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Instrument and analyze user interaction data (A/B tests, usage metrics) to inform design decisions and maximize product impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own implementation end to end across the stack, contributing in GoLang, Python, Typescript and Lua as projects require, using AI tools wherever possible.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Have&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience in Software Engineering/Computer Science&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working on user facing applications or services&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in one or more programming languages such as GoLang, Python, C#, and Javascript.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience collaborating cross-functionally with Product stakeholders to define requirements and deliver technical solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong commitment to designing, implementing, and maintaining systems that prioritize user safety, data integrity, and compliance with safety policies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;For roles that are based at our headquarters in San Mateo, CA: The starting base pay for this position is as shown below. The actual base pay is dependent upon a variety of job-related factors such as professional background, training, work experience, location, business needs and market demand. Therefore, in some circumstances, the actual salary could fall outside of this expected range. This pay range is subject to change and may be modified in the future. All full-time employees are also eligible for equity compensation and for benefits as described on &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.roblox.com/total-rewards&quot;&gt;this page&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Annual Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$182,170&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$227,370 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Roles that are based in an office are onsite Tuesday, Wednesday, and Thursday, with optional presence on Monday and Friday (unless otherwise noted).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Roblox provides equal employment opportunities to all employees and applicants for employment and prohibits discrimination and harassment of any type without regard to race, color, religion, age, sex, national origin, disability status, genetics, protected veteran status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state or local laws. Roblox also provides reasonable accommodations to candidates with qualifying disabilities or religious beliefs during the recruiting process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For US based roles only, please note the Company may not be able to employ candidates for this role who have United States work authorization related to certain U.S. visa categories, or support future H-1B sponsorship at this time.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Every day, tens of millions of people come to Roblox to explore, create, play, learn, and connect with friends in 3D immersive digital experiences– all created by our global community of developers and creators.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Roblox, we’re building the tools and platform that empower our community to bring any experience that they can imagine to life. Our vision is to reimagine the way people come together, from anywhere in the world, and on any device.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We’re on a mission to connect a billion people with optimism and civility, and looking for amazing talent to help us get there.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;A career at Roblox means you’ll be working to shape the future of human interaction, solving unique technical challenges at scale, and helping to create safer, more civil shared experiences for everyone.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Software Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; in our Creator Services Communication Pod, you will build the next generation communications plane to power the millions of experiences on the Roblox Platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To give some examples of what we do, we run the mission-critical &lt;a href=&quot;https://create.roblox.com/docs/cloud-services/cross-server-messaging&quot;&gt;Cross-server Messaging Service&lt;/a&gt;, which is crucial for Roblox game developers to implement leaderboards, cross-server announcements, live operations and more. We own the developer APIs for &lt;a href=&quot;https://create.roblox.com/docs/reference/engine/classes/HttpService&quot;&gt;HTTP calls&lt;/a&gt; to external systems and &lt;a href=&quot;https://create.roblox.com/docs/projects/teleport&quot;&gt;player teleports&lt;/a&gt; within and between game servers. We are also launching Compute Functions, which provide developers with a new surface to execute game logic for more robust features such as custom matchmaking, limited inventory drops, or any background task processing. To tie features like these together, we are building a general &lt;a href=&quot;https://devforum.roblox.com/t/introducing-server-management/3941907&quot;&gt;Game Server Management&lt;/a&gt; product to unify developers&#39; observability and control of their servers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At its core, this team is focused on solving complex back end distributed systems and networking problems at scale. However, our scope extends to full stack projects spanning all the way from the infrastructure layer, through engine development, data pipelines, microservices, telemetry, game servers, web development, UI, and UX design. This team collaborates on multiple cross-company efforts and our projects are of extremely high importance to Roblox. If you enjoy working on modern distributed systems, products for developers, C# and C++ software, and networking challenges alongside highly-experienced and passionate engineers, you will be right at home on our growing Creator Services team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years of professional software engineering experience, with strong ownership working in complex technical systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge: You are comfortable working with systems level programming languages (C++, C#, Objective C, Rust, or similar programming language).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curiosity: You are eager to work across a wide range of systems and understand the Roblox ecosystem end to end&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Long-term Mindset: You are considerate of how your work impacts the team/users over time, not just getting the green checkmark on a deliverable&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Will&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will develop new products and features that help creators make complex experiences including live game operations at many-million-player scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will support core systems at massive scale including how players move between game servers, how game servers communicate with each other, and how experiences interact with on and off platform services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will work across the technology stack such as the C++ game engine, Kafka streams, Flink jobs, Elasticsearch/Redis/Clickhouse databases, C# backend services, and React UIs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will take ownership of projects throughout their full lifecycles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
