&lt;li&gt;Work cross-functionally with other teams to deliver high-quality functionality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve product quality by writing automated tests for your code.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take ownership of features and projects, from design through launch.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and test code that runs across supported devices, including desktop, mobile, and console.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years of software engineering experience, with hands-on experience developing in C++.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Knowledge:&lt;/strong&gt; You are proficient in one or more programming languages (C++, C#, Go, Python or similar programming language). Familiarity with game engines, real-time systems, large-scale simulations or entity component systems is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
