&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong Teamwork:&lt;/strong&gt; You are able to collaborate in cross-functional and cross team projects to deliver the most curated technical solution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Long-term Mindset:&lt;/strong&gt; You are willing to take the long view to drive the collaboration and build the system.&lt;/li&gt;
