&lt;p&gt;As a Software Engineer on Economy, you’ll build the experiences users and creators interact with every day. You’ll own meaningful features from day one, ship work that directly moves the business, and learn alongside experienced engineers who are invested in your growth. You’ll partner closely with product, design, data science, ML, and backend teams on projects with high economic impact and real visibility.&lt;/p&gt;
