&lt;li&gt;Strong intuition for user experience. You notice when something feels off and you know how to fix it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working on consumer-facing products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curiosity and comfort with ambiguity. You ask good questions and contribute ideas that help shape a project’s direction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Computer Science, Computer Engineering, or a similar technical field (or equivalent experience).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bonus: Experience with e-commerce, marketplaces, monetization, personalization, or experimentation, or comfort contributing to backend services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
