&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Every day, tens of millions of people come to Roblox to explore, create, play, learn, and connect with friends in 3D immersive digital experiences– all created by our global community of developers and creators.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Roblox, we’re building the tools and platform that empower our community to bring any experience that they can imagine to life. Our vision is to reimagine the way people come together, from anywhere in the world, and on any device.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We’re on a mission to connect a billion people with optimism and civility, and looking for amazing talent to help us get there.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;A career at Roblox means you’ll be working to shape the future of human interaction, solving unique technical challenges at scale, and helping to create safer, more civil shared experiences for everyone.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;As a Software Engineer on the Notifications team, you&#39;ll build and operate the systems that deliver timely, relevant notifications to millions of Roblox users across push, in-app stream, email, and toast. You&#39;ll design, ship, and measure your own features, working with product, design, data science, and ML partners. If you&#39;re data-driven and care about getting the right message to the right person, you&#39;ll be right at home on this team!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and scale the pipeline that routes and delivers notifications across various channels, including onboarding new notification types for teams across Roblox&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ship and iterate on recommended notifications: candidate expansion, ranking and filtering, and notification presentation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run and analyze A/B experiments to improve reachability, engagement, and long-term retention&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to developer-facing notification APIs and operational excellence, including observability and on-call&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1–3 years of industry experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building backend or full-stack services&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with distributed systems or large-scale data pipelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An analytical mindset, with the ability to use data to understand the impact of your work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Respect for your teammates and a commitment to fostering a collaborative, inclusive environment&lt;/li&gt;
