&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Every day, tens of millions of people come to Roblox to explore, create, play, learn, and connect with friends in 3D immersive digital experiences– all created by our global community of developers and creators.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Roblox, we’re building the tools and platform that empower our community to bring any experience that they can imagine to life. Our vision is to reimagine the way people come together, from anywhere in the world, and on any device.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We’re on a mission to connect a billion people with optimism and civility, and looking for amazing talent to help us get there.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;A career at Roblox means you’ll be working to shape the future of human interaction, solving unique technical challenges at scale, and helping to create safer, more civil shared experiences for everyone.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;As a Software Engineer on the ROS team, you&#39;ll help shape the future of how we run the enterprise. You&#39;ll build the products and data platform that map how Roblox works — who our people are, how our organization is structured, and what work is happening — through products like Work Tracker, People App, Builder Profiles, and Org Chart. With AI transforming the way we work, you&#39;ll help make this company data trusted and accessible to both employees and AI agents, helping Roblox operate at 10x efficiency.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Will&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work across engineering, product, finance, people, and talent teams to innovate how we run the company, defining and refining requirements for high-impact internal products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive alignment across teams, shaping product requirements and ensuring everyone is working toward the same vision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead projects from end to end, ensuring they are well-planned, high-quality, and impactful.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work across a wide range of technologies, from frontend and backend to data pipelines and infrastructure, learning quickly to solve complex challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Uphold high engineering standards, building scalable, performant, and future-proof systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Explore and apply AI to improve efficiency, embracing new tools and approaches that drive a 10x impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;You Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1-3 years of experience in software engineering (internships included), with a track record of delivering high-quality production code.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Coding Proficiency:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong programming skills in at least one modern language (e.g., TypeScript, Python), with experience in a frontend framework such as React.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Problem-Solving Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; A solid understanding of computer science fundamentals, data structures, and algorithms, with an aptitude for debugging complex issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication&lt;/strong&gt;: Ability to work clearly and collaboratively with engineers and non-technical partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education: &lt;/strong&gt;A Bachelor&#39;s degree (or equivalent professional experience) in Computer Science or a related engineering field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please note the Company may not be able to employ candidates who have United States work authorization related to certain U.S. visa categories, or support future F-1 or H-1B sponsorship at this time.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;For roles that are based at our headquarters in San Mateo, CA: The starting base pay for this position is as shown below. The actual base pay is dependent upon a variety of job-related factors such as professional background, training, work experience, location, business needs and market demand. Therefore, in some circumstances, the actual salary could fall outside of this expected range. This pay range is subject to change and may be modified in the future. All full-time employees are also eligible for equity compensation and for benefits as described on &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.roblox.com/total-rewards&quot;&gt;this page&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Annual Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$168,680&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$212,490 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Roles that are based in an office are onsite Tuesday, Wednesday, and Thursday, with optional presence on Monday and Friday (unless otherwise noted).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Roblox provides equal employment opportunities to all employees and applicants for employment and prohibits discrimination and harassment of any type without regard to race, color, religion, age, sex, national origin, disability status, genetics, protected veteran status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state or local laws. Roblox also provides reasonable accommodations to candidates with qualifying disabilities or religious beliefs during the recruiting process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For US based roles only, please note the Company may not be able to employ candidates for this role who have United States work authorization related to certain U.S. visa categories, or support future H-1B sponsorship at this time.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Every day, tens of millions of people come to Roblox to explore, create, play, learn, and connect with friends in 3D immersive digital experiences– all created by our global community of developers and creators.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Roblox, we’re building the tools and platform that empower our community to bring any experience that they can imagine to life. Our vision is to reimagine the way people come together, from anywhere in the world, and on any device.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We’re on a mission to connect a billion people with optimism and civility, and looking for amazing talent to help us get there.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;A career at Roblox means you’ll be working to shape the future of human interaction, solving unique technical challenges at scale, and helping to create safer, more civil shared experiences for everyone.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for an outstanding engineer to join our Test Frameworks &amp;amp; Tooling team where we design, build and scale tools and services that power the test automation lifecycle of Roblox services.&amp;nbsp; Our systems span test frameworks, execution, orchestration and debugging, AI test generation, canary analysis.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build and scale test automation infrastructure&lt;/strong&gt;: Design, implement, and evolve the frameworks, runners, orchestration services, workflow integrations, and supporting infrastructure that power reliable testing across Roblox&#39;s supported platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Advance the AI-native test lifecycle&lt;/strong&gt;: Develop intelligent tooling that improves test authoring, selection, execution, maintenance, and failure triage, using AI to reduce manual effort and make testing more accessible and effective&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Develop test orchestration and intelligence&lt;/strong&gt;: Build systems that connect test planning, test selection, execution, and failure analysis, enabling more efficient use of test infrastructure and faster feedback to engineers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Improve test reliability and debugging&lt;/strong&gt;: Build tools and services that improve test stability, observability, failure diagnosis, and maintenance across a large and evolving test ecosystem&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shift quality earlier in the development lifecycle&lt;/strong&gt;: Integrate automated quality checks and actionable test feedback into development and CI/CD workflows to help teams identify and resolve issues earlier&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive projects end to end&lt;/strong&gt;: Take ownership of technical initiatives from problem definition, design, and implementation through production deployment, adoption, measurement, and continuous improvement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborate across engineering&lt;/strong&gt;: Partner with application, platform, QA, infrastructure, and developer productivity teams to develop scalable solutions that address the needs of engineers across Roblox&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You have:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;1+ years of experience&lt;/strong&gt; building large-scale backend or infrastructure systems. An understanding of building systems that operate at high QPS with low-latency requirements is a plus. Experience working on infrastructure or performance-critical backend systems is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Knowledge&lt;/strong&gt;: You are proficient in one or more programming languages (C#, Go, Python or similar programming language).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Curiosity&lt;/strong&gt;: You are curious and passionate about solving open-ended problems. You can identify challenges, develop a deep understanding of the systems involved, and drive solutions in collaboration with your team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong Teamwork: You are able to collaborate in cross-functional and cross team projects to deliver the most curated technical solution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Long-term Mindset&lt;/strong&gt;: You are willing to take the long view to drive the collaboration and build the system.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;For roles that are based at our headquarters in San Mateo, CA: The starting base pay for this position is as shown below. The actual base pay is dependent upon a variety of job-related factors such as professional background, training, work experience, location, business needs and market demand. Therefore, in some circumstances, the actual salary could fall outside of this expected range. This pay range is subject to change and may be modified in the future. All full-time employees are also eligible for equity compensation and for benefits as described on &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.roblox.com/total-rewards&quot;&gt;this page&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Annual Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$153,120&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$196,750 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Roles that are based in an office are onsite Tuesday, Wednesday, and Thursday, with optional presence on Monday and Friday (unless otherwise noted).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Roblox provides equal employment opportunities to all employees and applicants for employment and prohibits discrimination and harassment of any type without regard to race, color, religion, age, sex, national origin, disability status, genetics, protected veteran status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state or local laws. Roblox also provides reasonable accommodations to candidates with qualifying disabilities or religious beliefs during the recruiting process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For US based roles only, please note the Company may not be able to employ candidates for this role who have United States work authorization related to certain U.S. visa categories, or support future H-1B sponsorship at this time.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Every day, tens of millions of people come to Roblox to explore, create, play, learn, and connect with friends in 3D immersive digital experiences– all created by our global community of developers and creators.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Roblox, we’re building the tools and platform that empower our community to bring any experience that they can imagine to life. Our vision is to reimagine the way people come together, from anywhere in the world, and on any device.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We’re on a mission to connect a billion people with optimism and civility, and looking for amazing talent to help us get there.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;A career at Roblox means you’ll be working to shape the future of human interaction, solving unique technical challenges at scale, and helping to create safer, more civil shared experiences for everyone.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a Sr. Director, Executive Search to design, scale, and lead our executive search function. In this strategic role, you will partner directly with C-suite executives and senior leadership to identify, engage, and hire top-tier executive talent. You will combine high-touch candidate engagement, data-driven sourcing strategies, and expert negotiation to drive critical leadership hires across the organization. You&#39;ll occupy the following roles:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Consultant: &lt;/strong&gt;Partner with executives to accelerate product roadmaps, unlock innovation, and expand market share by aligning talent acquisition directly with corporate strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Elite Headhunter: &lt;/strong&gt;Lead executive searches with the discretion and taste of a top-tier boutique firm—securing our unfair share of exceptional, passive talent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience Architect: &lt;/strong&gt;Curate a differentiated, candidate-first recruiting journey to instill immediate trust, increasing offer-acceptance rates and fortifying internal confidence in the talent engine.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nurturer: &lt;/strong&gt;Establish and foster long-term relationships with world-class leaders to engage talent well before a need arises, transforming recruitment from a cost center into a competitive advantage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Insight Driver: &lt;/strong&gt;Use market signals, funnel intelligence, and pattern recognition to guide executive decision-making and provide high-leverage talent intelligence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Standard Bearer: &lt;/strong&gt;Set a relentless bar for rigor to hold the organization to elite standards, ensuring maximum talent density.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team Leader: &lt;/strong&gt;Recruit, mentor, and lead a high-performing team of executive recruiters, fostering a culture of excellence, collaboration, and continuous professional development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Velocity Engine: &lt;/strong&gt;Build a function known for velocity, discretion, and consistently landing the right leaders to successfully shape the company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leadership &amp;amp; Strategy: &lt;/strong&gt;Design and scale a world-class executive search function, including managing/coaching a small team, developing internal executive research capabilities, and leading succession planning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;End-to-End Recruitment: &lt;/strong&gt;Own and drive the entire executive recruitment lifecycle, from initial intake strategy to candidate offer and closing, ensuring a seamless, high-touch experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hands-on Execution: &lt;/strong&gt;Remain actively involved in full-cycle execution for high-priority, mission-critical searches, personally driving candidate generation, engagement, and closing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Market Mapping &amp;amp; Sourcing: &lt;/strong&gt;Develop sophisticated, data-driven market maps of executive talent across relevant technology and engineering domains.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Candidate Engagement: &lt;/strong&gt;Articulate the mission, vision, and culture compellingly to high-profile executive candidates, managing complex negotiations and relocation strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Confidentiality &amp;amp; Discretion: &lt;/strong&gt;Handle highly sensitive candidate information and internal organizational plans with complete discretion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Executive Advisory: &lt;/strong&gt;Serve as a trusted advisor to the CEO, C-suite, and senior leadership on talent planning and executive hiring best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Process Improvement: &lt;/strong&gt;Drive continuous improvement in executive search processes, leveraging modern tools, metrics, and interview methodologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Passive Candidate Conversion: &lt;/strong&gt;Execute tailored strategies to reach and convert highly passive executive talent into active candidates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience: &lt;/strong&gt;8+ years leading executive searches (Director level and above) and 15+ years of total recruiting experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Domain Expertise: &lt;/strong&gt;Proven track record recruiting executive talent in highly technical or rapidly scaling environments (e.g., software, hardware, AI/ML, autonomous systems).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication: &lt;/strong&gt;Exceptional written and verbal communication skills, with strong ability to influence and present to C-level executives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Negotiation &amp;amp; Closing: &lt;/strong&gt;Expertise in negotiating complex executive compensation packages and successfully closing candidates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Talent Intelligence: &lt;/strong&gt;Ability to provide real-time competitive intelligence, benchmarking, and market signals to guide leadership decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education: &lt;/strong&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree or equivalent practical experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Someone with a Proven Reputation:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Distinguished track record in leading executive searches that serves as a trust proxy, allowing you to build executive trust quickly and command market attention.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Excellent with Executive Operations:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Ability to navigate executive team dynamics with ease, acting as a high-judgment negotiator who knows when to push, wait, or hold the bar.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Quality Assurer: &lt;/strong&gt;Relentless advocacy for high talent density, prioritizing the long-term success of leadership hires over short-term requisition speed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Impact Prioritizer: &lt;/strong&gt;Driven by company-shaping outcomes, focusing energy on high-leverage hires that fundamentally move the needle for the organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Talent Attractor: &lt;/strong&gt;Embody the excellence of our brand to compellingly persuade passive industry leaders to join our mission.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;For roles that are based at our headquarters in San Mateo, CA: The starting base pay for this position is as shown below. The actual base pay is dependent upon a variety of job-related factors such as professional background, training, work experience, location, business needs and market demand. Therefore, in some circumstances, the actual salary could fall outside of this expected range. This pay range is subject to change and may be modified in the future. All full-time employees are also eligible for equity compensation and for benefits as described on &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.roblox.com/total-rewards&quot;&gt;this page&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Annual Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$323,030&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$364,920 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Roles that are based in an office are onsite Tuesday, Wednesday, and Thursday, with optional presence on Monday and Friday (unless otherwise noted).&lt;/p&gt;
